WEBVTT

00:01.441 --> 00:05.377
(grand orchestral fanfare
playing)

00:17.523 --> 00:18.886
Ooh.

00:18.887 --> 00:20.228
(grunts, laughs)

00:20.229 --> 00:22.626
(playing "Hammer BGM"
from Donkey Kong)

00:22.627 --> 00:25.958
(whimpering, shouting)

00:27.027 --> 00:28.302
Hey, stoppa, stoppa.

00:28.303 --> 00:30.370
- (yelps, sighs)
- (music stops)

00:30.371 --> 00:31.602
(muffled grunting)

00:31.603 --> 00:33.736
(muffled):
Illumination!

00:33.737 --> 00:35.177
(groans)

00:35.178 --> 00:38.872
("Ground BGM" from
Super Mario Bros. playing)

00:39.149 --> 00:40.347
(dings)

00:40.348 --> 00:42.349
♪ ♪

00:42.350 --> 00:43.042
(boings)

00:43.043 --> 00:45.945
("Course Clear" plays)

00:49.687 --> 00:51.621
(chimes)

00:55.264 --> 00:57.957
♪ ♪

01:28.924 --> 01:31.628
♪ ♪

01:51.419 --> 01:54.112
♪ ♪

01:57.953 --> 02:00.020
(singsongy):
Bedtime.

02:00.021 --> 02:02.088
Woo-hoo, bedtime!

02:02.089 --> 02:03.562
- Yes!
- (happy chattering)

02:03.563 --> 02:04.332
Oh, no.

02:04.333 --> 02:06.993
- Bedtime, bedtime, bedtime!
- (giggling)

02:07.501 --> 02:09.535
Did you wash your face?

02:09.536 --> 02:11.339
Yes.

02:11.340 --> 02:12.505
Mm... no.

02:12.506 --> 02:15.375
♪ ♪

02:15.608 --> 02:17.510
LUMA:
Story time! Story time!

02:17.511 --> 02:19.215
- (excited chattering)
- (giggling)

02:19.216 --> 02:21.382
- Woo-hoo!
- (Lumas trilling softly)

02:21.383 --> 02:24.319
- (laughing)
- Shh. Shh.

02:24.320 --> 02:26.551
(trills softly)

02:28.016 --> 02:29.324
"Once upon a time,

02:29.325 --> 02:34.021
"there was a brave
and noble princess named Peach.

02:34.022 --> 02:37.860
"She was the great protector
of the Mushroom Kingdom.

02:37.861 --> 02:40.335
Her story begins
many years ago..."

02:40.336 --> 02:42.997
I want to hear the story
about the plumbers.

02:42.998 --> 02:45.703
- Ooh, ooh.
- We did that one last night,

02:45.704 --> 02:48.244
and the night before
and the night before.

02:48.245 --> 02:49.905
(chanting):
Plumbers, plumbers.

02:49.906 --> 02:54.008
- Plumbers, plumbers, plumbers.
- Plumbers. Plumbers. Plumbers.

02:54.009 --> 02:55.108
- Plumbers.
- (laughs): Okay.

02:55.109 --> 02:58.551
Woo-hoo!
I'm hooked on the brothers.

02:58.552 --> 02:59.585
(sucking)

02:59.586 --> 03:01.257
"Mario and Luigi were..."

03:01.258 --> 03:03.655
- Get to the Donkey Kong part.
- Oh, oh.

03:03.656 --> 03:07.923
(chanting): Donkey Kong,
Donkey Kong, Donkey Kong,

03:07.924 --> 03:09.661
Donkey Kong, Donkey Kong,

03:09.662 --> 03:11.960
- Donkey...
- (heavy thudding in distance)

03:11.961 --> 03:12.862
(trills)

03:12.863 --> 03:16.502
- (heavy thudding continues)
- (trilling)

03:16.867 --> 03:18.901
Let's save the rest
for tomorrow.

03:18.902 --> 03:20.166
- Aw.
- Bummer.

03:20.167 --> 03:22.476
You all get tucked into bed,
all right?

03:22.477 --> 03:24.136
LUMA:
Boo.

03:25.073 --> 03:26.282
(thudding)

03:26.283 --> 03:29.383
I'll be right back.

03:29.583 --> 03:31.881
(heavy thudding continues)

03:31.882 --> 03:34.586
♪ ♪

03:45.797 --> 03:48.502
(deep, raspy voice):
Princess Rosalina,

03:48.503 --> 03:51.274
you're coming with me.

03:51.275 --> 03:53.968
♪ ♪

03:56.742 --> 04:00.008
- (grunts)
- (electrical crackling)

04:00.009 --> 04:01.613
(cries out)

04:10.789 --> 04:12.085
(grunts)

04:17.301 --> 04:18.795
(growls)

04:20.194 --> 04:22.062
(grunts)

04:26.772 --> 04:29.476
♪ ♪

04:32.008 --> 04:33.546
(yells)

04:35.946 --> 04:37.243
(loud crashing)

04:37.244 --> 04:39.519
(debris falling)

04:41.523 --> 04:43.491
(electrical crackling)

04:43.492 --> 04:45.559
You messed with the wrong...

04:45.560 --> 04:47.495
- LUMA: Mama?
- (gasps)

04:47.496 --> 04:50.090
I had a bad dream.

04:50.290 --> 04:53.731
Uh-oh. It wasn't a dream.

04:55.262 --> 04:56.800
(gasps)

05:00.608 --> 05:02.872
(popping explosions)

05:04.612 --> 05:06.909
(frightened shouts)

05:07.351 --> 05:09.615
- (gasping)
- Wha...?

05:16.118 --> 05:19.218
- (mechanical clicking)
- (grunts)

05:20.991 --> 05:22.959
(panting)

05:22.960 --> 05:25.433
(mechanical clicking)

05:27.327 --> 05:28.063
(gasps)

05:28.064 --> 05:31.164
- (hissing)
- ♪ ♪

05:33.300 --> 05:38.645
From the ashes of his father's
defeat rises a new conqueror.

05:38.646 --> 05:43.012
The Bowser name
shall be feared once more.

05:43.013 --> 05:45.047
(Kamek cackling)

05:45.048 --> 05:46.488
Will you shut up?

05:46.489 --> 05:48.919
I'm just so happy for you.

05:48.920 --> 05:51.856
Your first princess-napping!

05:51.857 --> 05:53.660
(grunting angrily)

05:53.661 --> 05:55.661
Leave my mama alone!

05:56.026 --> 05:57.862
- (groans)
- No!

05:57.863 --> 06:00.402
(cackling)

06:04.364 --> 06:06.738
(gasping)

06:10.106 --> 06:12.843
♪ ♪

06:13.340 --> 06:16.781
(trilling sadly, whimpering)

06:17.146 --> 06:19.883
♪ ♪

06:29.224 --> 06:31.994
(wind blowing)

06:38.607 --> 06:41.169
(high-pitched grumbling)

06:41.170 --> 06:43.039
- (footsteps)
- Huh?

06:43.040 --> 06:43.941
(groans)

06:43.942 --> 06:45.371
- (yelps)
- (bones clicking)

06:45.372 --> 06:47.340
- (engines roaring)
- ♪ ♪

06:47.341 --> 06:49.616
(Goomba yelps, mutters)

06:50.014 --> 06:52.410
BOTH:
Wahoo!

06:55.349 --> 06:58.086
♪ ♪

07:03.423 --> 07:05.995
(Pokey yelps)

07:15.512 --> 07:17.479
Woo-hoo!

07:20.110 --> 07:21.583
(laughing)

07:21.584 --> 07:24.277
♪ ♪

07:24.884 --> 07:27.852
- (Mario cheers)
- LUIGI: Woo-hoo!

07:36.599 --> 07:38.192
(engines stop)

07:44.167 --> 07:45.607
- (laughing)
- Hey, huh?

07:45.608 --> 07:48.302
Lu, that jump you hit
back there...

07:48.303 --> 07:51.470
Mario, are we cool
motorcycle guys now?

07:51.471 --> 07:52.273
Obviously.

07:52.274 --> 07:54.517
- Oh, you're here.
- Oh.

07:54.518 --> 07:57.113
Now, where's
the troubled pipes?

07:57.114 --> 08:00.523
(overlapping,
excited chattering)

08:00.524 --> 08:02.283
(laughs):
Okay, okay.

08:02.284 --> 08:03.988
How about pointing?

08:03.989 --> 08:06.253
(distant roaring)

08:06.728 --> 08:08.992
(maraca rattling)

08:09.698 --> 08:12.534
- (rattling stops)
- (distant bellowing)

08:13.130 --> 08:15.834
♪ ♪

08:19.499 --> 08:20.873
(deep bellowing)

08:20.874 --> 08:24.040
(Swoops squeaking)

08:26.880 --> 08:29.815
♪ ♪

08:32.754 --> 08:34.887
(whooshes)

08:34.888 --> 08:37.757
("Power-Up" plays)

08:42.258 --> 08:44.962
♪ ♪

09:04.280 --> 09:06.115
(grunts)

09:06.282 --> 09:09.184
(Swoops squeaking)

09:11.760 --> 09:13.189
(distant bellowing)

09:13.190 --> 09:17.490
Okay, I guess we'll just
follow that terrifying noise.

09:17.491 --> 09:19.898
(groans)

09:25.532 --> 09:26.367
Come on.

09:26.368 --> 09:28.336
You're not
the scared guy anymore.

09:28.337 --> 09:29.205
(shrieks)

09:29.206 --> 09:32.141
Yes, I am! People don't change!

09:34.541 --> 09:36.244
(grunts)

09:38.248 --> 09:41.183
(bellowing)

09:46.487 --> 09:49.357
(rumbling growl echoes)

09:49.358 --> 09:52.491
There's the problem.

09:54.594 --> 09:57.332
(straining)

09:57.333 --> 09:58.432
(grunts)

09:58.433 --> 10:00.169
Ooh.

10:04.043 --> 10:05.648
- (growling)
- (screaming)

10:05.649 --> 10:07.375
Put the bricks back.
Put the bricks back.

10:07.376 --> 10:10.818
I looked down that hole,
and the devil looked back.

10:10.819 --> 10:11.984
(Luigi yelps)

10:11.985 --> 10:14.755
(squawks)

10:15.054 --> 10:17.021
(whooshing)

10:18.552 --> 10:20.420
(purring growl)

10:21.060 --> 10:23.093
(whimpers)

10:25.328 --> 10:27.801
(whimpers softly)

10:28.397 --> 10:31.465
Hey. It's all right.

10:31.466 --> 10:33.873
(purring)

10:35.008 --> 10:36.602
(whimpers)

10:36.603 --> 10:39.307
♪ ♪

10:40.178 --> 10:42.508
Easy.

10:43.049 --> 10:44.643
(coos softly)

10:44.644 --> 10:46.413
(purrs)

10:47.284 --> 10:48.614
- (sniffs)
- ♪ ♪

10:48.615 --> 10:50.825
- (chatters) Ah.
- Hey, okay.

10:50.826 --> 10:52.321
Okay, now.

10:52.322 --> 10:54.224
What's your name, little guy?

10:54.225 --> 10:55.489
Yoshi.

10:55.490 --> 10:56.930
Nice to meet you, Yoshi.

10:56.931 --> 10:59.427
How did you get in a warp pipe?

10:59.428 --> 11:00.395
Oh...

11:00.396 --> 11:02.628
(warbling excitedly)

11:02.629 --> 11:05.333
♪ ♪

11:06.567 --> 11:08.501
(chimes)

11:08.976 --> 11:11.076
(yawns)

11:11.077 --> 11:12.176
(gasps)

11:12.177 --> 11:14.881
♪ ♪

11:18.216 --> 11:20.887
(warbling excitedly)

11:21.516 --> 11:24.320
("Hypnotize"
by The Notorious B.I.G. plays)

11:24.321 --> 11:26.992
MAN:
Out of the road!

11:27.456 --> 11:28.994
(grunts)

11:29.491 --> 11:32.064
- (cat shrieks)
- (sniffs)

11:32.065 --> 11:32.735
(growls)

11:32.736 --> 11:34.330
- (grunts)
- (dog whimpers)

11:34.331 --> 11:35.529
(muffled barking)

11:35.530 --> 11:38.102
(bicycle bell rings)

11:38.236 --> 11:39.203
(grunts, chews)

11:39.204 --> 11:42.403
- OFFICER:
We got a 1-9-8-1 monkey...
- (hooting)

11:43.406 --> 11:45.780
(exclaims)

11:46.178 --> 11:47.376
(high-pitched chatter)

11:47.377 --> 11:50.444
- Mm? Wh...? Oh!
- (creaking)

11:52.613 --> 11:54.680
(groans sheepishly)

11:54.681 --> 11:56.220
(warbling)

11:56.221 --> 11:57.551
(sirens wailing)

11:57.552 --> 11:59.717
(horn blasts)

12:00.093 --> 12:01.357
(gasps, screams)

12:01.358 --> 12:02.897
("Pipe Travel" plays)

12:02.898 --> 12:04.800
(chatters)

12:04.801 --> 12:07.033
I guess we'll never know.

12:07.034 --> 12:08.529
(chatters)

12:08.530 --> 12:11.300
(murmuring)

12:11.698 --> 12:13.039
♪ ♪

12:13.040 --> 12:15.074
- Found the problem.
- Ah.

12:15.075 --> 12:17.911
(cheering, excited chattering)

12:18.441 --> 12:21.145
(Yoshi coos inquisitively)

12:22.313 --> 12:24.446
- Hola, Yoshi.
- Yoshi.

12:24.447 --> 12:26.184
Yoshi. Yoshi.

12:26.185 --> 12:28.923
- Yoshi. Yoshi.
- (laughs)

12:28.924 --> 12:31.222
All that trouble over a Yoshi.

12:31.223 --> 12:35.720
Yeah. You know, we found
the little fella and...

12:36.228 --> 12:38.756
Where'd he go?

12:39.165 --> 12:40.396
Huh.

12:40.397 --> 12:42.431
Well, he seemed like
a nice guy.

12:42.432 --> 12:43.630
(engine revving)

12:43.631 --> 12:46.006
♪ ♪

12:46.007 --> 12:48.305
Rrr, rrr. (laughs)

12:48.306 --> 12:51.440
He knows that's my bike, right?

12:51.441 --> 12:53.409
♪ ♪

12:53.410 --> 12:55.817
(Luigi shrieks)

12:56.017 --> 12:58.952
(Luigi screaming)

13:01.385 --> 13:03.990
(screaming continues)

13:10.493 --> 13:13.197
♪ ♪

13:26.344 --> 13:28.982
♪ ♪

13:32.317 --> 13:35.022
ROSALINA:
Where are you taking us?

13:35.023 --> 13:37.057
Try and enjoy it, Princess.

13:37.058 --> 13:42.556
It's the last place
you'll ever see alive.

13:46.969 --> 13:49.662
♪ ♪

14:17.527 --> 14:20.198
♪ ♪

14:22.037 --> 14:24.532
(whooshes)

14:31.211 --> 14:35.114
(workers chattering)

14:37.217 --> 14:38.811
It's pretty cool, right?

14:38.812 --> 14:42.022
I really think my dad's
gonna love it.

14:45.225 --> 14:47.358
Mama, I'm scared.

14:47.359 --> 14:49.821
It's gonna be all right.

14:51.363 --> 14:53.627
(Kamek laughing)

15:03.309 --> 15:04.606
My Koopas,

15:04.607 --> 15:06.839
guess who stole a princess.

15:06.840 --> 15:08.478
- Ah... (laughs)
- (cheering)

15:08.479 --> 15:10.381
BOWSER JR.:
And not just any princess.

15:10.382 --> 15:14.583
The guardian of the cosmos,
the mother of the stars.

15:14.584 --> 15:18.961
With her powers,
we will destroy the universe!

15:18.962 --> 15:22.690
She will give her life
for our glory!

15:22.691 --> 15:23.559
(cheering)

15:23.560 --> 15:25.627
How's that for a speech?

15:25.628 --> 15:28.497
Very descriptive.

15:31.535 --> 15:33.305
Ow! Ow!

15:33.306 --> 15:34.108
(groans)

15:34.109 --> 15:38.243
No one hurts my kids.

15:39.246 --> 15:41.741
(shouting)

15:42.678 --> 15:44.514
Go!

15:44.515 --> 15:45.416
(grunts)

15:45.417 --> 15:48.781
- (Yellow Luma trills)
- (grunting)

15:49.091 --> 15:50.421
(whooshes)

15:50.422 --> 15:51.949
(grunting)

15:56.065 --> 15:58.693
(roars)

15:58.694 --> 16:01.860
(strained grunting)

16:02.368 --> 16:03.632
(wand clatters to ground)

16:03.633 --> 16:07.339
The great battle
of my life draws near.

16:07.340 --> 16:11.837
It is time to free my father.

16:13.181 --> 16:16.050
(insects chirping)

16:16.976 --> 16:19.614
♪ ♪

16:34.928 --> 16:36.038
Think she'll like it?

16:36.039 --> 16:40.504
Mario, do you have feelings
for the princess?

16:40.505 --> 16:41.736
- What?!
- (kissing sounds)

16:41.737 --> 16:43.672
Oh, what? Can't a guy give
his good buddy

16:43.673 --> 16:48.149
a perfect present
to-to show her just
how much she means to him?

16:48.150 --> 16:52.450
♪ When the moon hits your eye ♪

16:52.451 --> 16:54.254
♪ Like a big pizza pie ♪

16:54.255 --> 16:57.356
- ♪ That's... ♪
- ♪ A-Yoshi. ♪

16:57.357 --> 16:59.655
I'm not in love with Peach.

16:59.656 --> 17:01.558
Mwah, mwah.

17:01.559 --> 17:04.429
- (Yoshi laughs)
- Let's just go.

17:04.430 --> 17:06.024
♪ ♪

17:06.025 --> 17:09.269
("Too Hot to Stop - Pt. 1"
by The Bar-Kays playing)

17:09.270 --> 17:11.106
♪ ♪

17:11.107 --> 17:12.239
♪ Yeah, yeah ♪

17:12.240 --> 17:15.572
- ♪ Hey, hey ♪
- PHOTOGRAPHER: Say "mushroom."

17:15.573 --> 17:18.344
♪ Yeah... ♪

17:18.345 --> 17:20.312
Ooh.

17:24.846 --> 17:26.385
(gulps) Mmm.

17:26.386 --> 17:27.848
Hey, guys.

17:27.849 --> 17:28.750
Hey, Toad.

17:28.751 --> 17:31.422
- Looking good.
- (Yoshi exclaims)

17:31.985 --> 17:34.129
Um, who is this?

17:34.130 --> 17:36.395
- (gulps) Yoshi.
- (chuckles)

17:36.396 --> 17:39.827
- Who could resist that face?
- Aw...

17:39.828 --> 17:41.532
(Mario and Luigi laughing)

17:41.533 --> 17:42.863
Come on.

17:42.864 --> 17:45.173
So some cool dinosaur
just shows up

17:45.174 --> 17:47.065
and he's now part of the group.

17:47.066 --> 17:50.276
- ♪ ♪
- (lively chatter)

17:54.183 --> 17:56.679
Hey, uh, have you seen
the princess?

17:56.680 --> 17:58.417
Nope.

17:58.418 --> 18:01.155
♪ ♪

18:04.457 --> 18:07.953
(music and chatter continue
muffled in distance)

18:08.131 --> 18:11.133
(whistling, popping)

18:11.134 --> 18:14.498
♪ ♪

18:17.404 --> 18:20.097
♪ ♪

18:30.384 --> 18:31.384
Hey.

18:31.385 --> 18:33.584
You're missing your own party.

18:33.585 --> 18:35.080
(Princess Peach sighs)

18:35.081 --> 18:37.522
I hate birthdays.

18:37.523 --> 18:38.325
Yeah.

18:38.326 --> 18:41.020
Luigi spent
his tenth birthday crying.

18:41.021 --> 18:44.199
Said his childhood was over.

18:44.200 --> 18:44.958
(laughs)

18:44.959 --> 18:49.402
Well, the crazy thing is,
today's not my real birthday.

18:49.403 --> 18:52.273
It's just the day
the Toads found me.

18:52.274 --> 18:54.968
They have no idea
where I came from.

18:54.969 --> 19:00.413
I've lived my entire life
wondering where my family is.

19:00.414 --> 19:02.877
- That must be so hard.
- (sighs)

19:02.878 --> 19:07.353
Sometimes I just feel so lost.

19:08.950 --> 19:12.293
Guess since it's not
your actual birthday,

19:12.294 --> 19:14.196
you don't want a present.

19:14.197 --> 19:15.362
Mario! (laughs)

19:15.363 --> 19:18.496
(laughing):
All right. Fine, fine.

19:21.402 --> 19:23.402
PRINCESS PEACH:
Oh.

19:25.505 --> 19:27.638
(giggling)

19:27.639 --> 19:29.474
I love it.

19:34.382 --> 19:36.547
MARIO:
Huh?

19:36.780 --> 19:39.419
(whooshing)

19:39.420 --> 19:41.816
Whoa.

19:42.522 --> 19:45.259
♪ ♪

19:52.928 --> 19:54.797
(Luigi gasps)

19:54.798 --> 19:56.435
Look.

20:05.446 --> 20:07.447
(gasps)

20:07.448 --> 20:10.317
(happy chattering)

20:10.913 --> 20:13.386
- Wow.
- Whoa.

20:13.487 --> 20:15.949
- Whoa.
- (laughter)

20:19.020 --> 20:20.493
(laughing)

20:20.494 --> 20:22.626
(sniffing) Oh.

20:23.024 --> 20:24.925
(sneezes)

20:30.834 --> 20:32.538
(laughs)

20:32.539 --> 20:34.869
(Princess Peach laughs)

20:37.104 --> 20:39.874
♪ ♪

20:41.009 --> 20:42.943
(gasps)

20:52.559 --> 20:54.955
(booming)

20:58.433 --> 21:01.159
♪ ♪

21:17.848 --> 21:20.618
(tinkling)

21:26.857 --> 21:27.692
(trilling)

21:27.693 --> 21:32.334
(weakly): Princess Peach,
I finally found you.

21:32.335 --> 21:33.434
Oh.

21:33.435 --> 21:36.293
(insects trilling)

21:41.806 --> 21:44.169
Feel better now?

21:45.480 --> 21:47.580
I can't believe
it's really you.

21:47.581 --> 21:52.013
Our mama read us so many
bedtime stories about you.

21:52.014 --> 21:53.586
Me?

21:53.587 --> 21:54.521
Are you sure?

21:54.522 --> 21:57.150
She said if anything
ever happened to her,

21:57.151 --> 22:00.527
to find you
and you would help us.

22:00.528 --> 22:03.563
Princess,
our mama's been taken.

22:03.564 --> 22:04.399
What happened?

22:04.400 --> 22:07.292
A giant robot took her
to a scary planet

22:07.293 --> 22:09.998
out beyond the Gateway Galaxy.

22:09.999 --> 22:11.933
Can you help us?

22:12.870 --> 22:14.167
(grunting)

22:14.168 --> 22:15.542
(gasps)

22:15.543 --> 22:18.336
Uh, Peach, sorry, I tried...

22:18.337 --> 22:19.744
Yes, yes,
we were eavesdropping.

22:19.745 --> 22:21.449
Don't you even
think about leaving.

22:21.450 --> 22:24.243
Guys, can we just give
the princess a minute?

22:24.244 --> 22:26.344
She'll figure out what to do.

22:26.345 --> 22:28.016
I disagree, Mario.

22:28.017 --> 22:30.282
Even though my pajamas
say otherwise.

22:30.283 --> 22:32.350
There is nothing to figure out.

22:32.351 --> 22:33.725
She is not leaving.

22:33.726 --> 22:34.957
OTHERS:
Yes, yes, yes.

22:34.958 --> 22:36.354
All right, guys, let's go.

22:36.355 --> 22:39.598
We can discuss more
in the morning.

22:40.997 --> 22:43.360
Good night, Princess.

22:43.637 --> 22:46.363
♪ ♪

22:52.514 --> 22:54.845
Toad, pack our things.

22:54.846 --> 22:57.418
♪ ♪

23:07.188 --> 23:09.386
(chimes)

23:18.573 --> 23:20.771
(whooshing)

23:23.578 --> 23:26.646
(whirring)

23:26.647 --> 23:28.450
TOAD:
Whoa!

23:28.451 --> 23:31.144
♪ ♪

23:33.379 --> 23:37.557
Woo-hoo-hoo-hoo!

23:42.696 --> 23:43.696
What happened?

23:43.697 --> 23:45.730
She left this for you.

23:48.064 --> 23:49.328
PRINCESS PEACH:
Dear Mustache,

23:49.329 --> 23:52.100
I've gone to the Gateway Galaxy
to begin my search

23:52.101 --> 23:53.365
for the Luma's mom.

23:53.366 --> 23:56.511
I'm leaving the Kingdom
in your hands.

23:56.512 --> 23:59.975
Sincerely, Peach.

24:00.846 --> 24:01.681
"Sincerely."

24:01.682 --> 24:04.717
Ooh la la. That's a good sign.

24:04.718 --> 24:06.587
Princess Peach is gone?

24:06.588 --> 24:07.819
Oh, no!

24:07.820 --> 24:09.920
(screaming, clamoring)

24:09.921 --> 24:11.987
(sobbing)

24:12.088 --> 24:14.825
Everyone, calm down.

24:15.223 --> 24:16.960
The Super Mario Brothers

24:16.961 --> 24:19.424
can take care of the Kingdom.

24:19.425 --> 24:22.162
♪ ♪

24:25.431 --> 24:27.201
(buzzing)

24:27.202 --> 24:30.302
- (whimpers)
- (growls)

24:36.717 --> 24:39.047
(grunting)

24:42.217 --> 24:43.789
(dings)

24:43.790 --> 24:46.153
(buzzing)

24:49.532 --> 24:51.829
("Power-Up" plays)

24:53.360 --> 24:55.064
(laughs)

24:55.065 --> 24:56.131
(muffled shout)

24:56.132 --> 24:58.001
- (dings)
- (buzzing)

24:58.002 --> 25:01.641
- (screaming)
- (Chain Chomp barking)

25:03.942 --> 25:05.778
(barking)

25:05.779 --> 25:07.472
(dings)

25:07.473 --> 25:08.715
(buzzing)

25:08.716 --> 25:11.046
(screaming)

25:11.312 --> 25:13.346
- LUIGI: Ha!
- ("Power-Up" plays)

25:13.347 --> 25:15.622
(croaks)

25:19.419 --> 25:21.023
(yells)

25:24.028 --> 25:26.127
(Toad squeals)

25:26.932 --> 25:27.635
Woo-hoo!

25:27.636 --> 25:30.736
- ♪ ♪
- (grunting)

25:37.646 --> 25:41.340
- (grunting)
- (Goombas growl)

25:43.080 --> 25:45.047
(grunts)

25:45.654 --> 25:47.918
("Pipe Travel" plays)

25:48.349 --> 25:50.448
(laughs)

25:50.791 --> 25:53.517
(yelps, grunts)

26:00.031 --> 26:01.361
(moans weakly)

26:01.362 --> 26:03.363
- (buzzing)
- (groans)

26:03.364 --> 26:05.101
Now what?

26:05.102 --> 26:08.433
(thunder crashing)

26:08.710 --> 26:11.040
(sighs)

26:11.273 --> 26:14.681
(grunts, shouts)

26:18.082 --> 26:19.478
(growls)

26:19.479 --> 26:21.655
(grunts)

26:24.385 --> 26:26.451
(yells)

26:27.553 --> 26:29.663
(grunts)

26:30.325 --> 26:33.095
♪ ♪

26:38.707 --> 26:40.906
- Hey, big guy.
- (high-pitched scream)

26:40.907 --> 26:41.742
Aah! Oh.

26:41.743 --> 26:43.711
You scared me.

26:43.712 --> 26:44.943
You wanted to see us?

26:44.944 --> 26:47.572
Don't move. I'll be right up.

26:47.573 --> 26:49.882
(humming happily)

26:49.883 --> 26:52.016
♪ Sippin' the soup ♪
(slurps)

26:52.017 --> 26:53.919
♪ Cleaning the paint ♪

26:53.920 --> 26:56.218
(continues humming)

26:56.219 --> 26:59.793
♪ And also trim
the bonsai bush. ♪

26:59.794 --> 27:02.091
Here we go.

27:06.295 --> 27:09.362
(laughs) Hey, Luigi!

27:09.771 --> 27:11.673
What's up, Mario?

27:11.674 --> 27:12.872
(grunts)

27:12.873 --> 27:13.631
Behold.

27:13.632 --> 27:17.338
I made a masterpiece
for Princess Peach.

27:17.339 --> 27:19.604
What do you think?

27:19.605 --> 27:21.715
And be honest.

27:22.641 --> 27:24.444
Love the colors.

27:24.445 --> 27:28.118
The criticism I'd give you
is it's trash.

27:28.119 --> 27:31.484
How dare you look at
my masterpiece and say that!

27:31.485 --> 27:33.255
You think painting is easy?

27:33.256 --> 27:37.192
I'll burn the skin
off your bones!

27:37.590 --> 27:39.767
Wow. (chuckles)

27:39.768 --> 27:40.735
Sorry about that.

27:40.736 --> 27:42.000
That's the old Bowser talking.

27:42.001 --> 27:46.532
(chuckles) Still working
through my demons, I suppose.

27:46.533 --> 27:48.633
(laughs) All good.

27:48.634 --> 27:49.843
All better now.

27:49.844 --> 27:52.813
Anyway,
it's not just a present.

27:52.814 --> 27:54.639
It's a peace offering.

27:54.640 --> 27:55.915
I'd like her to release me.

27:55.916 --> 27:59.886
Not for good behavior,
for awesome behavior!

27:59.887 --> 28:01.019
She'd never release you.

28:01.020 --> 28:03.516
And don't even ask
about making you big again.

28:03.517 --> 28:06.288
Even though
I'm totally rehabilitated?

28:06.289 --> 28:07.729
Mario, he's really changed.

28:07.730 --> 28:10.765
We're doing a weekly
book club together.

28:10.766 --> 28:11.832
I bring the soup.

28:11.833 --> 28:16.264
She doesn't trust you,
and neither do I.

28:16.497 --> 28:18.201
Oh, you better start
trusting me

28:18.202 --> 28:22.105
or I will eat your soul and...

28:22.536 --> 28:23.569
(laughs nervously)

28:23.570 --> 28:25.439
I'm sorry, that... It's just...

28:25.440 --> 28:26.704
Oh, wow. (chuckles)

28:26.705 --> 28:30.576
All right. You know what, guys,
I'm gonna hit the sack.

28:30.577 --> 28:31.676
I need my eight hours

28:31.677 --> 28:34.987
or else I really turn
into a monster. (laughs)

28:34.988 --> 28:36.516
(screams) Ow!

28:36.517 --> 28:37.649
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

28:37.650 --> 28:39.354
- (shouting in pain)
- (clattering)

28:39.355 --> 28:42.687
Stubbed it! Stubbed it!
Stubbed the dang toe!

28:42.688 --> 28:44.194
(screaming)

28:44.195 --> 28:45.096
(shouts)

28:45.097 --> 28:47.659
(chuckles) Nighty night.

28:47.660 --> 28:49.199
(deep rumbling)

28:49.200 --> 28:50.772
- (whimpering)
- Uh...

28:50.773 --> 28:53.697
(panicked murmuring)

28:56.009 --> 28:58.075
(groans)

28:58.638 --> 29:00.913
MARIO:
Huh?

29:03.852 --> 29:06.578
(crackling)

29:07.746 --> 29:10.858
- (deep rumbling)
- (murmuring)

29:10.859 --> 29:12.156
(gasps)

29:12.157 --> 29:14.157
(clattering)

29:17.261 --> 29:20.031
♪ ♪

29:26.105 --> 29:27.599
(exclaiming)

29:35.213 --> 29:37.048
(cries out)

29:38.249 --> 29:40.953
(screaming)

29:43.122 --> 29:45.090
We got to get everyone
out of here.

29:45.091 --> 29:47.554
- Go, go, go!
- (panicked shouting)

29:47.555 --> 29:50.028
(screaming)

29:51.592 --> 29:53.790
(shouting)

29:54.397 --> 29:55.166
(gasps)

29:55.167 --> 29:58.036
(panicked shouting)

30:03.043 --> 30:06.143
- (rumbling)
- (high-pitched scream)

30:06.475 --> 30:09.443
(screaming, shouting)

30:16.089 --> 30:18.815
♪ ♪

30:29.201 --> 30:32.235
That's everyone. Let's go.

30:33.733 --> 30:34.975
(Luigi yells)

30:34.976 --> 30:37.571
- (grunts)
- (Yoshi warbling)

30:37.572 --> 30:39.705
(grunting)

30:39.706 --> 30:41.982
(groaning)

30:41.983 --> 30:44.082
Whoa.

30:45.481 --> 30:48.218
♪ ♪

30:52.653 --> 30:56.325
Mamma mia.

30:57.163 --> 30:59.493
YOSHI:
Whoa.

31:02.905 --> 31:03.729
(gasps)

31:03.730 --> 31:06.599
(propeller whirring)

31:12.376 --> 31:14.772
(gasping)

31:20.285 --> 31:21.483
(Luigi whimpers)

31:21.484 --> 31:23.287
In the name of the Koopas,

31:23.288 --> 31:27.059
I demand that you release
my father.

31:28.557 --> 31:31.064
Over my dead body.

31:31.065 --> 31:33.626
Fine with me.

31:44.672 --> 31:45.837
(chuckles menacingly)

31:45.838 --> 31:49.214
Why don't we start over
and introduce ourselves?

31:49.215 --> 31:52.514
Okay, uh, hi. I'm Luigi.

31:52.515 --> 31:54.186
I'm Bowser Jr.,

31:54.187 --> 31:57.915
and I'm gonna be
taking my father now.

31:57.916 --> 32:00.323
(Mario and Luigi scream)

32:01.887 --> 32:05.131
- (Mario and Luigi exclaim)
- (Bowser Jr. growls)

32:05.132 --> 32:07.594
(grunting)

32:09.697 --> 32:12.005
(Yoshi exclaims)

32:13.041 --> 32:14.767
(cries out)

32:14.768 --> 32:17.241
(grunting)

32:20.774 --> 32:22.840
Whoa.

32:26.021 --> 32:27.186
(yells)

32:27.187 --> 32:29.187
(groaning)

32:30.850 --> 32:32.488
(growls)

32:32.489 --> 32:34.885
♪ ♪

32:35.294 --> 32:37.657
(groans) Ooh, ooh, ooh.

32:38.330 --> 32:39.330
(Mario screams)

32:39.331 --> 32:40.958
(roaring viciously)

32:40.959 --> 32:42.003
(whimpers)

32:42.004 --> 32:44.037
(cries out)

32:49.011 --> 32:50.901
(screams)

32:51.079 --> 32:53.211
(Luigi whimpering)

32:53.906 --> 32:56.248
(Yoshi squeaking)

32:56.249 --> 32:58.282
(Yoshi yelps)

32:59.879 --> 33:01.318
(gasps)

33:03.619 --> 33:05.124
(panting)

33:06.523 --> 33:09.161
(muffled explosion)

33:12.727 --> 33:13.562
(gasps)

33:13.563 --> 33:16.268
(heavy footsteps)

33:16.269 --> 33:19.138
(Yoshi screams)

33:19.800 --> 33:21.603
You've been doing so great,

33:21.604 --> 33:24.144
but thought you might
need a hand.

33:24.145 --> 33:26.541
- (warbles)
- (screams)

33:27.313 --> 33:30.083
YOSHI:
Ah...

33:30.481 --> 33:32.712
(gulps)

33:33.352 --> 33:35.287
(giggles)

33:35.288 --> 33:37.013
(grunts)

33:38.357 --> 33:40.193
(screams)

33:40.194 --> 33:42.327
- (growling fiercely)
- (whimpers)

33:42.328 --> 33:44.295
(beeping)

33:45.100 --> 33:47.892
(both yelling)

33:48.895 --> 33:51.797
(Kamek's muffled grunts)

33:52.173 --> 33:54.108
(explosion)

33:54.109 --> 33:56.836
- (grunts)
- (yelps)

33:56.837 --> 33:59.739
(power winding down)

34:00.907 --> 34:03.007
♪ ♪

34:03.008 --> 34:05.844
(whimpering)

34:06.682 --> 34:08.715
(screaming)

34:12.952 --> 34:13.952
Dad!

34:13.953 --> 34:17.791
(Mario, Luigi and Yoshi
screaming)

34:17.792 --> 34:19.363
Hold on!

34:20.795 --> 34:22.400
(deep rumbling)

34:22.401 --> 34:23.928
(screaming)

34:25.833 --> 34:28.032
(screaming)

34:28.033 --> 34:30.506
(grunting)

34:40.485 --> 34:43.651
(all shouting)

34:45.523 --> 34:47.326
(whimpering)

34:47.327 --> 34:50.625
(rumbling continues)

34:57.095 --> 34:59.404
(sighing heavily)

34:59.405 --> 35:02.439
(rumbling)

35:05.708 --> 35:08.072
- (Yoshi screaming)
- (gasping)

35:08.073 --> 35:10.810
(all screaming)

35:11.747 --> 35:14.286
(debris falling)

35:16.224 --> 35:18.258
(groans)

35:18.259 --> 35:19.754
(Luigi coughing)

35:19.755 --> 35:22.118
Everyone okay?

35:22.758 --> 35:24.264
(Yoshi warbles)

35:24.265 --> 35:26.859
Where are we?

35:30.667 --> 35:31.766
Ha!

35:31.767 --> 35:33.031
(laughing)

35:33.032 --> 35:34.835
Sweet freedom!

35:34.836 --> 35:36.705
You got to be kidding me.

35:36.706 --> 35:38.476
Bye, suckers.

35:38.477 --> 35:40.071
Hey, get back here.

35:40.072 --> 35:43.107
No. You can't catch the wind.

35:43.108 --> 35:45.912
(Bowser panting heavily)

35:45.913 --> 35:47.617
(laughs, grunts)

35:47.618 --> 35:48.882
I just kind of did.

35:48.883 --> 35:50.818
It was a metaphor!

35:50.819 --> 35:53.194
- (crunching)
- (screams)

35:53.195 --> 35:55.328
Ow! Ow! Ow!

35:55.329 --> 35:56.329
Hey.

35:56.330 --> 35:58.661
(Mario yells)

35:58.662 --> 35:59.398
Ow! Ow!

35:59.399 --> 36:01.565
- (crunching)
- (screams) Stop it!

36:01.566 --> 36:03.160
Never!

36:03.161 --> 36:04.304
(yelps)

36:04.305 --> 36:06.130
(muffled shouting)

36:06.131 --> 36:07.032
(screaming)

36:07.033 --> 36:10.309
(sighs) You should
probably spit him out.

36:14.579 --> 36:15.381
Ooh.

36:15.382 --> 36:17.911
(laughs) That was intense.

36:17.912 --> 36:21.112
Guys, this is embarrassing.

36:21.113 --> 36:24.456
I'm still a tiny
work in progress.

36:24.457 --> 36:25.424
Sorry, pal.

36:25.425 --> 36:27.888
You expect me to shake
the hand of the turtle

36:27.889 --> 36:30.330
whose son just attacked me?

36:30.331 --> 36:33.189
My son?

36:33.895 --> 36:35.027
(sighs)

36:35.028 --> 36:37.700
I haven't seen him in years.

36:37.701 --> 36:41.737
Mario, I was a terrible father.

36:41.738 --> 36:43.574
He must hate me.

36:43.575 --> 36:44.575
Hate you?

36:44.576 --> 36:48.040
Your son tried to chop
my head off just to free you.

36:48.041 --> 36:49.910
He wants to see you.

36:49.911 --> 36:53.386
He could just use
some guidance.

36:53.387 --> 36:54.255
Really?

36:54.256 --> 36:58.182
You think I might have a shot
at reconnecting with my boy?

36:58.183 --> 36:59.117
Aw. See, Mario?

36:59.118 --> 37:02.428
He's gotten really in touch
with his feelings.

37:02.429 --> 37:03.693
I'm drowning in 'em.

37:03.694 --> 37:05.057
All right,
let's just keep moving.

37:05.058 --> 37:09.566
We got to find a way off
this planet and get to Peach.

37:09.832 --> 37:12.569
♪ ♪

37:17.103 --> 37:19.235
(chimes)

37:27.718 --> 37:30.290
Look! There it is!

37:40.401 --> 37:43.028
(Princess Peach exclaims)

37:44.933 --> 37:46.901
♪ ♪

37:46.902 --> 37:48.265
(squawking)

37:48.266 --> 37:51.004
- (gasps)
- TOAD: Whoa.

37:51.005 --> 37:54.545
PIANTA MOTHER:
Come on. We're gonna be late.

37:54.811 --> 37:59.319
Whoa. The Gateway Galaxy.

38:04.656 --> 38:07.559
ANNOUNCER (over P.A.):
Welcome to Gateway Galaxy.

38:07.560 --> 38:10.397
Your gateway to the galaxies.

38:10.398 --> 38:12.090
(chirping)

38:13.368 --> 38:14.500
(gasps)

38:14.501 --> 38:15.765
Toad, where are you going?

38:15.766 --> 38:18.998
This must be
who we're looking for.

38:24.412 --> 38:26.137
(gasps)

38:32.277 --> 38:35.047
(whooshing)

38:37.282 --> 38:39.459
YOUNG PEACH:
No! No!

38:39.460 --> 38:41.493
(screams)

38:41.660 --> 38:43.320
(breathing heavily)

38:43.321 --> 38:44.728
Princess?

38:44.729 --> 38:47.092
Are you okay?

38:47.864 --> 38:50.832
(whimpers sadly)

38:52.165 --> 38:54.067
Ukiki is lost.

38:54.068 --> 38:57.972
Have you seen Ukiki's friends?

38:57.973 --> 38:58.775
Oh.

38:58.776 --> 39:00.975
We've got a lost little monkey.

39:00.976 --> 39:03.681
I got ya. I got ya.

39:03.682 --> 39:05.683
- (grunts)
- (cackling)

39:05.684 --> 39:09.280
That monkey just used
his cuteness for crime!

39:09.281 --> 39:10.248
Toad, wait.

39:10.249 --> 39:13.218
All of our Power-Ups
and coins are in there.

39:13.219 --> 39:16.253
And my unfinished novel!

39:17.025 --> 39:20.323
- Pardon me.
- Excuse me. Sorry.

39:21.326 --> 39:22.326
Got him.

39:22.327 --> 39:23.997
(groans)

39:24.736 --> 39:26.505
(grunts)

39:26.936 --> 39:28.167
(grunts)

39:28.168 --> 39:30.444
(chitters)

39:30.445 --> 39:32.237
We got you now.

39:32.238 --> 39:34.513
(chitters)

39:35.780 --> 39:37.418
(laughs)

39:37.419 --> 39:38.177
(chimes)

39:38.178 --> 39:40.849
Monkey jumped through the wall!

39:46.725 --> 39:49.462
(chiming)

39:58.440 --> 40:00.100
(quiet chatter)

40:00.101 --> 40:02.102
(chatter stops)

40:02.103 --> 40:04.005
(heavy footsteps)

40:04.006 --> 40:05.710
(can pops open)

40:05.711 --> 40:08.613
(Sledge Bro growls)

40:09.176 --> 40:10.814
Stay close.

40:10.815 --> 40:13.453
(quiet murmuring)

40:17.085 --> 40:18.888
(Shy Guy grunts)

40:18.889 --> 40:20.824
(cackling)

40:20.825 --> 40:21.924
(snarls)

40:21.925 --> 40:23.420
(Goomba snorts)

40:23.421 --> 40:26.125
♪ ♪

40:32.199 --> 40:33.100
Hey, you!

40:33.101 --> 40:35.476
(Ukiki chitters,
blows raspberries)

40:35.477 --> 40:36.774
TOAD:
Hey!

40:36.775 --> 40:39.006
Give me my backpack!

40:48.523 --> 40:50.051
(Bowser Jr. growls
in frustration)

40:50.052 --> 40:52.493
Dad, I know you're
down there somewhere.

40:52.494 --> 40:54.253
(Kamek sobbing)

40:54.254 --> 40:56.288
Sire, it is hopeless.

40:56.289 --> 40:59.225
The important thing now
in our time of grief

40:59.226 --> 41:03.669
is to stay strong
for each other.

41:03.670 --> 41:06.100
Will you get ahold of yourself?

41:06.101 --> 41:08.575
We got to keep looking
for Papa.

41:08.576 --> 41:10.137
(Kamek whimpers)

41:10.138 --> 41:12.469
♪ ♪

41:12.470 --> 41:14.339
(Bowser whispering)

41:14.340 --> 41:18.310
So, um, Bowser wants to talk
to you about something.

41:18.311 --> 41:20.411
(inhales deeply)

41:20.412 --> 41:21.346
You know, Mario,

41:21.347 --> 41:24.756
all boys believe their fathers
are larger than life.

41:24.757 --> 41:29.057
I don't want to disappoint
my boy by being so small.

41:29.058 --> 41:31.158
I'm not making you big.

41:31.159 --> 41:34.898
You're used to living
a pint-sized life,

41:34.899 --> 41:36.801
but I was born to be big!

41:36.802 --> 41:38.671
Undo the power
of the Blue Mushroom,

41:38.672 --> 41:42.609
and I shall fight by your side
for all of eternity.

41:42.610 --> 41:44.138
That's a good deal.

41:44.139 --> 41:45.909
Eternity's a long time.

41:45.910 --> 41:48.109
We will be unstoppable.

41:48.110 --> 41:49.374
MARIO:
Hmm.

41:49.375 --> 41:51.948
- No.
- Come on, hit me, Mario.

41:51.949 --> 41:52.718
Hit me!

41:52.719 --> 41:54.280
Yeah, Mario, hit him.
We-we can trust him.

41:54.281 --> 41:57.382
- Hit me!
- Mario, just go ahead
and hit him.

41:57.383 --> 41:58.350
- Come on.
- Ha!

41:58.351 --> 42:03.255
Hit me now, you tiny,
pathetic failure of a plumber!

42:03.488 --> 42:05.598
(yells angrily)

42:06.425 --> 42:07.524
(grunts)

42:07.525 --> 42:09.866
(Bowser yells)

42:13.069 --> 42:15.905
(deep, rumbling roar)

42:17.645 --> 42:20.745
(whimpering)

42:22.144 --> 42:24.310
(smooching)

42:24.311 --> 42:25.916
- (pops)
- (groans in disgust)

42:25.917 --> 42:28.720
You will not regret this.

42:29.690 --> 42:30.888
(Luigi laughs)

42:30.889 --> 42:32.593
- Aw.
- (groans)

42:32.594 --> 42:34.188
What are you guys waiting for?

42:34.189 --> 42:35.860
There's a castle up there.

42:35.861 --> 42:37.928
Come on. Follow me.

42:37.929 --> 42:40.700
♪ ♪

42:40.701 --> 42:41.767
(yells)

42:41.768 --> 42:43.967
BOB-OMB:
Hey! (sizzling)

42:43.968 --> 42:45.528
(explosion)

42:48.401 --> 42:50.270
(Toad grunts)

42:50.271 --> 42:52.107
- (grunts)
- Sorry.

42:52.108 --> 42:53.009
Whoa!

42:53.010 --> 42:55.044
(cries out)

42:55.045 --> 42:57.749
♪ ♪

43:00.050 --> 43:02.479
TOAD:
Whoa.

43:06.694 --> 43:09.794
- (machines beeping)
- (crowd chatter)

43:22.204 --> 43:25.106
♪ ♪

43:29.310 --> 43:30.046
(gasps)

43:30.047 --> 43:32.014
(whispers):
Princess.

43:33.886 --> 43:37.019
♪ ♪

43:39.056 --> 43:41.452
(chittering)

43:46.734 --> 43:51.628
Ukiki,
look at what you brought me.

43:51.629 --> 43:53.465
(deep laughter)

43:53.466 --> 43:55.170
(belches)

43:55.171 --> 43:59.910
Princesses are very valuable.

44:00.341 --> 44:03.079
Ukiki thinks your novel stinks!

44:03.080 --> 44:04.080
Ow!

44:04.081 --> 44:05.884
(Wart, Ukiki
and goons laughing)

44:05.885 --> 44:08.886
(laughter echoing)

44:09.691 --> 44:10.515
What is it

44:10.516 --> 44:14.552
with you princesses
and getting captured?

44:14.553 --> 44:17.928
You know something about
that missing princess?

44:18.656 --> 44:20.261
Mmm.

44:20.262 --> 44:23.363
Not a thing.

44:23.364 --> 44:25.706
You listen to me,
you slimeball.

44:25.707 --> 44:29.941
You're gonna tell me exactly
where Rosalina is.

44:29.942 --> 44:32.140
Or what?

44:32.670 --> 44:34.275
(loud snapping)

44:34.276 --> 44:35.309
(cackling)

44:35.310 --> 44:37.409
(grunts)

44:37.576 --> 44:39.786
(Mouser sneering)

44:39.787 --> 44:42.348
(clattering, whirring)

44:43.186 --> 44:45.352
(clicking, jingling)

44:45.353 --> 44:47.683
(Mouser cackles)

44:50.424 --> 44:52.458
(Princess Peach grunting)

44:52.459 --> 44:53.965
(sizzling)

44:53.966 --> 44:55.427
(explosions)

44:58.300 --> 45:00.565
(Mouser groans)

45:00.566 --> 45:03.072
(Mouser screams)

45:03.536 --> 45:05.570
Oh, Princess.

45:05.571 --> 45:08.639
You're going to regret that.

45:08.640 --> 45:10.509
(alarm blaring)

45:10.510 --> 45:11.851
(rapid clicking)

45:11.852 --> 45:14.754
- Oh!
- (panicked shouting)

45:20.553 --> 45:22.894
(grunting)

45:24.491 --> 45:26.766
(Princess Peach yells)

45:31.663 --> 45:34.005
♪ ♪

45:34.006 --> 45:35.270
(yells)

45:35.271 --> 45:36.304
(Toad grunts)

45:36.305 --> 45:39.538
- ("Power-Up" plays)
- (laughs)

45:39.539 --> 45:42.111
♪ ♪

45:43.510 --> 45:45.609
(Toad exclaims)

45:48.449 --> 45:50.285
PRINCESS PEACH:
Hyah!

45:50.286 --> 45:52.792
♪ ♪

45:54.686 --> 45:56.027
Hyah!

45:56.028 --> 45:58.292
Oh!

45:59.328 --> 46:01.296
(slurping)

46:01.297 --> 46:04.034
(grunting)

46:13.375 --> 46:14.979
(gasps)

46:19.117 --> 46:20.821
(Princess Peach yells)

46:20.822 --> 46:23.252
♪ ♪

46:23.253 --> 46:25.485
- (moans)
- (chiming)

46:25.486 --> 46:27.959
Ooh, yes!

46:37.938 --> 46:40.598
- (shouts)
- (clattering)

46:46.309 --> 46:48.375
(roaring viciously)

46:50.918 --> 46:52.951
(grunting)

46:53.448 --> 46:55.185
Where is she?

46:55.186 --> 46:58.385
Do I look like a snitch?

46:58.684 --> 47:00.619
("Power-Up" plays)

47:00.620 --> 47:02.423
Oh! Yes, I do.

47:02.424 --> 47:04.194
This is your last chance.

47:04.195 --> 47:05.591
Okay, okay. Listen to me.

47:05.592 --> 47:08.363
- Bowser's kid took her.
- Where?

47:08.364 --> 47:10.826
The Space Junk Galaxy.

47:11.730 --> 47:13.236
(grunts)

47:13.237 --> 47:15.237
(groans)

47:15.371 --> 47:16.976
PRINCESS PEACH:
Toad.

47:16.977 --> 47:19.703
- Give me that.
- (Ukiki squeaks)

47:20.948 --> 47:25.247
Get me Bowser Jr. now!

47:27.086 --> 47:30.582
Move those little legs, shortcake.

47:32.927 --> 47:33.751
Hi.

47:33.752 --> 47:36.061
We need some help
getting off your planet.

47:36.062 --> 47:38.030
You will have to speak
to the queen.

47:38.031 --> 47:40.934
But the scary-looking guy
stays here.

47:40.935 --> 47:42.265
BOWSER:
Hmm.

47:42.266 --> 47:44.564
I got this.

47:44.565 --> 47:47.533
♪ ♪

47:49.702 --> 47:50.944
Hello, Your Highness.

47:50.945 --> 47:54.343
We are trying to get
to the Gateway Galax...

47:54.344 --> 47:59.117
You're the aliens who destroyed
my flower fields.

47:59.118 --> 48:00.712
Imprison them!

48:00.713 --> 48:03.219
Take them to the honey mines!

48:04.750 --> 48:07.454
Not on my watch.

48:10.030 --> 48:12.856
Someone must pay
for their crimes.

48:12.857 --> 48:13.890
Release them!

48:13.891 --> 48:16.266
I shall serve their sentence
in their stead.

48:16.267 --> 48:19.038
I can do the work
of a hundred men

48:19.039 --> 48:21.073
and at least 10,000 bees.

48:21.074 --> 48:25.737
Take me and send them
to the Gateway Galaxy.

48:25.738 --> 48:27.276
(gasps)

48:30.479 --> 48:31.710
(clinks)

48:31.711 --> 48:32.876
Hmm.

48:32.877 --> 48:34.119
We have a deal.

48:34.120 --> 48:36.748
Get them to the Gateway Galaxy.

48:36.749 --> 48:38.815
(whimpers)

48:39.785 --> 48:42.126
Are you sure about this?

48:43.426 --> 48:46.823
You're not as horrible
as I thought.

48:47.298 --> 48:49.068
Thank you.

48:49.069 --> 48:50.531
Put that away.

48:50.532 --> 48:52.632
(grunts)

48:52.633 --> 48:54.700
You take care of him, okay?

48:54.701 --> 48:56.141
I always do.

48:56.142 --> 49:01.475
This miserable bug
will give you passage.

49:06.746 --> 49:08.087
Go!

49:08.088 --> 49:11.023
Make your old enemy proud.

49:18.659 --> 49:21.396
♪ ♪

49:30.737 --> 49:31.671
(strained grunt)

49:31.672 --> 49:35.279
When I'm free, me and my girl
are gonna go dancing

49:35.280 --> 49:36.808
till the sun rises.

49:36.809 --> 49:39.019
You got a honey back home?

49:39.020 --> 49:40.251
(sighs)

49:40.252 --> 49:42.187
She bailed at the altar.

49:42.188 --> 49:44.255
Left me twisted in the wind.

49:44.256 --> 49:46.026
I'm still healing,

49:46.027 --> 49:49.556
remembering who I was
before her.

49:49.657 --> 49:52.724
(voice breaks):
That is one sensitive soul.

49:54.101 --> 49:55.694
(gasps)

49:56.532 --> 49:57.664
Huh?

49:57.665 --> 49:58.566
Stay strong!

49:58.567 --> 50:00.766
You'll find
the right one someday!

50:00.767 --> 50:02.405
(yells)

50:02.406 --> 50:05.704
Ooh. (grunts)

50:07.576 --> 50:09.005
(gasps)

50:09.006 --> 50:11.150
Hi, Dad.

50:11.151 --> 50:12.382
Junior?

50:12.383 --> 50:15.681
(laughs):
Oh, my boy!

50:16.783 --> 50:19.454
You got so big.

50:19.852 --> 50:22.424
This is all yours?

50:22.690 --> 50:25.857
Hey, aren't you supposed
to be at boarding school?

50:25.858 --> 50:26.825
Boarding school?

50:26.826 --> 50:28.299
More like boring school.

50:28.300 --> 50:29.465
I got expelled.

50:29.466 --> 50:30.367
(laughs)

50:30.368 --> 50:33.502
You really grew up
when I wasn't paying attention.

50:33.503 --> 50:35.141
Dad, we're about to become

50:35.142 --> 50:39.178
the two most powerful dudes
in the universe.

50:39.179 --> 50:40.608
Remember when
I was a baby turtle?

50:40.609 --> 50:44.447
You were working so hard
trying to conquer the world.

50:44.448 --> 50:46.119
But once in a while,
you'd have a night off,

50:46.120 --> 50:50.156
and you'd tuck me in and tell
me our favorite bedtime story.

50:50.157 --> 50:53.686
Those were the best nights
of my life.

50:53.853 --> 50:55.425
Tell me the story.

50:55.426 --> 50:56.822
Again?

50:56.823 --> 50:59.054
(Bowser laughs)

51:11.178 --> 51:12.970
BOWSER:
Back in the days of yore,

51:12.971 --> 51:16.677
there was a powerful villain
with awesome hair.

51:16.678 --> 51:19.251
He loved conquering everything.

51:19.252 --> 51:21.077
(growling)

51:21.078 --> 51:22.078
(grunts)

51:22.079 --> 51:25.982
You see,
this villain had a son.

51:26.655 --> 51:27.820
The two roamed the universe

51:27.821 --> 51:29.756
desperate for a place
to call home,

51:29.757 --> 51:34.563
but everywhere they went
was just incredibly lame.

51:34.564 --> 51:35.366
Gross!

51:35.367 --> 51:38.534
So they decided
to make their own planet.

51:38.535 --> 51:41.372
Behold Planet Bowser,

51:41.373 --> 51:42.703
a sinister sanctuary

51:42.704 --> 51:45.277
where they could spend
the rest of their days.

51:45.278 --> 51:48.071
They built
an evil roller coaster,

51:48.072 --> 51:49.347
a gorge full of lava.

51:49.348 --> 51:53.846
And they carved
a giant mountain into
the shape of their heads.

51:53.847 --> 51:55.980
And at the top of the planet

51:55.981 --> 51:58.290
they built
the biggest cannon ever.

51:58.291 --> 52:02.161
It could destroy the universe!

52:02.328 --> 52:03.559
They called it...

52:03.560 --> 52:05.330
The Boomsday Weapon!

52:05.331 --> 52:07.024
To power it, they needed...

52:07.025 --> 52:10.236
The most powerful princess
in the universe!

52:10.237 --> 52:12.667
And when they had drained
all her power

52:12.668 --> 52:16.638
and the weapon was ready,
they went planet by planet,

52:16.639 --> 52:20.609
destroying all those
who disrespected them.

52:20.610 --> 52:21.379
Boom!

52:21.380 --> 52:23.942
- Boom!
- Boom!

52:23.943 --> 52:27.187
Until they danced
on the ashes of the universe

52:27.188 --> 52:29.552
and reigned supreme!

52:29.553 --> 52:32.082
The end.

52:32.083 --> 52:34.722
Dad, will you tell me again
tomorrow night?

52:34.723 --> 52:36.020
Of course.

52:36.021 --> 52:37.593
Good night, my boy.

52:37.594 --> 52:39.363
Mwah.

52:42.599 --> 52:43.962
Shh.

52:43.963 --> 52:47.372
Dad, I built us that planet.

52:47.373 --> 52:48.538
You did?

52:48.539 --> 52:50.408
We're going there right now.

52:50.409 --> 52:51.607
You and me.

52:51.608 --> 52:54.708
Two Bowsers, no limits.

52:57.009 --> 52:58.108
(cackles)

52:58.109 --> 53:00.682
(singsongy):
My lords.

53:00.683 --> 53:04.179
(normal):
We have a problem.

53:06.524 --> 53:09.262
(clicking)

53:09.263 --> 53:11.990
- (metallic clapping)
- (Princess Peach grunts)

53:11.991 --> 53:15.091
(straining)

53:16.567 --> 53:18.798
(metallic clattering)

53:19.339 --> 53:21.901
(robotic voice): Welcome to
the information booth.

53:21.902 --> 53:23.309
My name is R.O.B.

53:23.310 --> 53:25.641
Would you like
some information?

53:25.642 --> 53:27.577
We need to find a pilot,
and quick.

53:27.578 --> 53:31.174
Certainly. Pilots can be found
on the flight deck,

53:31.175 --> 53:37.553
which is located right over...

53:38.050 --> 53:41.019
(continues):
...over...

53:41.020 --> 53:43.791
Oh, R.O.B., you're killing me!

53:43.792 --> 53:44.990
I'm sorry.

53:44.991 --> 53:47.025
I do not wish to kill you.

53:47.026 --> 53:48.191
Ugh! Toad!

53:48.192 --> 53:49.632
- I am R.O.B.
- I know!

53:49.633 --> 53:52.228
Great. Thanks for visiting
information.

53:52.229 --> 53:54.472
Where is the flight deck?

53:54.473 --> 53:56.672
Right over...

53:56.673 --> 53:58.036
(both groan)

53:58.037 --> 53:59.972
...over... here.

53:59.973 --> 54:02.612
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

54:02.613 --> 54:04.943
♪ ♪

54:05.319 --> 54:07.913
("Pipe Travel" plays)

54:11.820 --> 54:13.854
Whee!

54:13.855 --> 54:16.493
("Pipe Travel" plays)

54:20.499 --> 54:23.533
(engine roars)

54:35.481 --> 54:38.273
(whooshing)

54:39.782 --> 54:42.013
(engine roars)

54:50.056 --> 54:53.464
(excited, high-pitched
chattering)

54:54.665 --> 54:55.698
Hi there.

54:55.699 --> 54:58.602
Can you take us
to the Space Junk Galaxy?

54:58.603 --> 55:00.538
Uh, nope.

55:00.539 --> 55:01.638
(scoffs)

55:01.639 --> 55:02.441
Excuse me.

55:02.442 --> 55:04.443
How much to take us
to the Space Junk Galaxy?

55:04.444 --> 55:06.610
Too dangerous
for this little flyboy.

55:06.611 --> 55:09.206
- (sighs)
- VOICE: So, tell me this.

55:09.207 --> 55:10.548
Why is a princess

55:10.549 --> 55:13.815
trying to go to the most
dangerous place in the galaxy?

55:13.816 --> 55:15.487
Who are you?

55:15.488 --> 55:17.588
Don't ask me
personal questions.

55:17.589 --> 55:20.085
Oh, I'm-I'm so sorry.
I didn't...

55:20.086 --> 55:22.021
I'm Fox McCloud!

55:22.022 --> 55:22.956
♪ ♪

55:22.957 --> 55:27.158
Leader of the legendary
Star Fox team!

55:27.159 --> 55:29.061
I only care about three things:

55:29.062 --> 55:30.634
keeping the Lylat System safe,

55:30.635 --> 55:31.734
fighting with my buds,

55:31.735 --> 55:36.673
and doing extremely dangerous
barrel rolls!

55:36.674 --> 55:37.674
Let's go!

55:37.675 --> 55:39.874
Then one day,
my warp drive exploded,

55:39.875 --> 55:42.008
blew a giant hole in
the fabric of space and time,

55:42.009 --> 55:44.142
and I got sucked
into a different universe.

55:44.143 --> 55:47.486
That's what I get
for making a frog my engineer.

55:47.487 --> 55:48.146
(croaks)

55:48.147 --> 55:49.455
Now I roam your galaxy,

55:49.456 --> 55:51.050
trying to find a way home,

55:51.051 --> 55:54.822
doing good
when the price is right.

55:55.253 --> 55:57.858
Oh, I also have
cool space boots.

55:57.959 --> 55:59.091
(softly):
Whoa.

55:59.092 --> 56:01.258
Now, that's the backstory
of the guy

56:01.259 --> 56:04.030
who's going to take us
to the Space Junk Galaxy.

56:04.031 --> 56:07.869
How desperate for money
do you think I am?

56:07.870 --> 56:10.607
(dinging)

56:11.038 --> 56:12.335
All right, you got a deal.

56:12.336 --> 56:13.578
I'll fuel up the Arwing.

56:13.579 --> 56:16.239
We'll take off in five.

56:18.716 --> 56:24.116
That was the coolest dude
I've ever seen.

56:24.117 --> 56:27.316
♪ ♪

56:29.430 --> 56:32.124
Mario, I have a great idea.

56:32.125 --> 56:33.191
When you see Peach,

56:33.192 --> 56:36.194
you should catch up and go,
"Blah, blah, blah.

56:36.195 --> 56:37.866
Oh, hi. How are you?"

56:37.867 --> 56:38.867
And then, boom!

56:38.868 --> 56:41.903
You should ask her out
on a date.

56:41.904 --> 56:43.003
I don't know, Lu.

56:43.004 --> 56:46.545
You think a princess would
ever date a plumber?

56:46.546 --> 56:47.810
(Yoshi whimpers)

56:47.811 --> 56:48.877
Mario.

56:48.878 --> 56:51.517
She would be the luckiest
princess in the world

56:51.518 --> 56:54.278
- to be your girlfriend.
- YOSHI: Uh-huh.

56:54.279 --> 56:55.411
She is going to say yes,

56:55.412 --> 56:59.723
and then you're gonna ask her
if she has a friend for me.

56:59.724 --> 57:00.592
(chuckles)

57:00.593 --> 57:04.255
Now we just need to find her.

57:04.256 --> 57:08.094
She is right over...

57:08.095 --> 57:10.965
- (continues): over...
- (groaning)

57:10.966 --> 57:13.605
- ("Pipe Travel" plays)
- MARIO: Peach!

57:13.606 --> 57:15.200
Peach!

57:15.201 --> 57:16.333
Mario?

57:16.334 --> 57:18.268
(laughs excitedly)

57:18.908 --> 57:21.338
Oh. Yoshi's here.

57:21.339 --> 57:22.108
Yay.

57:22.109 --> 57:25.308
Mario! (chuckles)

57:25.882 --> 57:26.717
A handshake?

57:26.718 --> 57:28.114
Thought it could be cool.

57:28.115 --> 57:30.523
I mean,
just thought it could be cool.

57:30.524 --> 57:33.416
That-that would
be good and cool.

57:33.417 --> 57:35.660
Mario, I found out
where Rosalina is.

57:35.661 --> 57:38.630
And this guy's gonna
take us there.

57:38.631 --> 57:42.226
♪ ♪

57:45.297 --> 57:46.704
Nice ride.

57:46.705 --> 57:49.002
Nice 'stache.

57:49.576 --> 57:50.466
Let's go.

57:50.467 --> 57:53.777
(beeping, whirring)

57:53.778 --> 57:55.207
(grunts)

57:55.208 --> 57:57.142
Yahoo!

57:58.277 --> 58:01.146
(engine rumbling)

58:01.654 --> 58:03.786
♪ ♪

58:05.757 --> 58:08.450
(whooshing)

58:10.762 --> 58:12.961
You got to love a space rogue!

58:12.962 --> 58:14.699
He doesn't look like
a rogue to me.

58:14.700 --> 58:17.163
He looks like
Ms. Castellano's dog.

58:17.164 --> 58:17.999
(chuckles)

58:18.000 --> 58:20.496
Can Ms. Castellano's dog
do this?

58:20.497 --> 58:22.234
TOAD (laughs):
Oh!

58:22.235 --> 58:25.468
PRINCESS PEACH:
Woo-hoo-hoo! (laughs)

58:25.469 --> 58:27.437
Woo-hoo!

58:27.438 --> 58:30.109
I like this guy.

58:31.508 --> 58:34.509
(rumbling explosion)

58:36.920 --> 58:39.624
(Princess Peach and Luigi gasp)

58:40.418 --> 58:42.088
(beeping)

58:43.960 --> 58:47.225
Might want to hang on
to something.

58:50.934 --> 58:52.703
Oh!

58:53.739 --> 58:56.839
- (explosion)
- Woo-hoo!

59:04.310 --> 59:06.717
(gasps)

59:07.852 --> 59:09.017
(growls fiercely)

59:09.018 --> 59:11.513
(explosions)

59:19.457 --> 59:20.863
(beeps)

59:22.196 --> 59:23.427
(explosion)

59:23.428 --> 59:27.331
(growls)
They're gonna pay for that!

59:31.568 --> 59:33.272
Wait, Junior.

59:33.273 --> 59:34.911
I kind of got to know them.

59:34.912 --> 59:36.143
They're super lame,

59:36.144 --> 59:38.684
but I'd still feel bad
about killing them.

59:38.685 --> 59:42.016
What are you talking about?
Not kill them?

59:42.546 --> 59:43.887
Well, that's weird.

59:43.888 --> 59:46.890
Okay. Doing this one
for you, Dad.

59:46.891 --> 59:49.486
When I'm done with them,
they'll be crying

59:49.487 --> 59:50.729
for their mommies.

59:50.730 --> 59:53.830
Uh, what's that gonna do?

59:57.231 --> 59:59.770
(chuckles)

01:00:01.136 --> 01:00:02.301
Bowser.

01:00:02.302 --> 01:00:04.335
He played us.

01:00:05.943 --> 01:00:08.471
(beeping)

01:00:11.685 --> 01:00:13.685
(both gasp)

01:00:14.479 --> 01:00:15.611
(giggling)

01:00:15.612 --> 01:00:18.481
(chuckles):
Oh, babies.

01:00:21.453 --> 01:00:23.157
(distorted):
Wha...

01:00:23.158 --> 01:00:26.126
- (normal): Ow!
- (giggling)

01:00:28.427 --> 01:00:29.229
No!

01:00:29.230 --> 01:00:31.066
Boom! (chuckles)

01:00:31.067 --> 01:00:34.200
(Toad screaming, wailing)

01:00:35.775 --> 01:00:37.435
Don't worry, Dad.

01:00:37.436 --> 01:00:38.535
This time tomorrow,

01:00:38.536 --> 01:00:42.341
you'll have forgotten all about
those dorks in overalls.

01:00:42.342 --> 01:00:46.213
The whole universe
will be ours!

01:00:46.214 --> 01:00:48.314
- (screaming)
- (laughing)

01:00:48.315 --> 01:00:51.481
- (rapid beeping)
- (Fox yelling)

01:00:52.319 --> 01:00:56.420
- PRINCESS PEACH: Whoa!
- FOX: Hold on!

01:01:00.360 --> 01:01:01.734
(Princess Peach panting)

01:01:01.735 --> 01:01:04.066
(Mario and Luigi cooing,
giggling)

01:01:04.067 --> 01:01:06.529
(Toad grunts)

01:01:08.269 --> 01:01:09.401
(electrical crackling)

01:01:09.402 --> 01:01:11.304
- How about now?
- (Mario and Luigi giggling)

01:01:11.305 --> 01:01:13.713
(engine whirs, stops)

01:01:13.714 --> 01:01:15.341
Nope.

01:01:15.342 --> 01:01:17.639
Toad, the babies!

01:01:18.884 --> 01:01:21.511
Wha... On it.

01:01:22.217 --> 01:01:24.614
- (exclaims)
- (gasps)

01:01:24.615 --> 01:01:25.648
(cooing)

01:01:25.649 --> 01:01:28.584
- Come here.
- (giggling)

01:01:29.158 --> 01:01:30.927
(coos, giggles)

01:01:31.798 --> 01:01:33.358
(Yoshi exclaims)

01:01:35.736 --> 01:01:37.802
Whoo!

01:01:41.874 --> 01:01:42.808
Huh?

01:01:42.809 --> 01:01:45.601
(low snoring)

01:01:48.210 --> 01:01:49.540
(gasps)

01:01:49.541 --> 01:01:52.377
(low snoring)

01:01:53.578 --> 01:01:54.710
(shrieks)

01:01:54.711 --> 01:01:56.316
(gasping rapidly)

01:01:56.317 --> 01:01:58.021
(whispers):
Yoshi!

01:01:58.022 --> 01:01:59.154
Come back!

01:01:59.155 --> 01:02:00.991
Yoshi. Yoshi.

01:02:00.992 --> 01:02:02.421
Yoshi!

01:02:02.422 --> 01:02:03.092
(gasps)

01:02:03.093 --> 01:02:05.523
- (Mario giggling)
- (snoring continues)

01:02:05.524 --> 01:02:07.195
(giggles)

01:02:07.196 --> 01:02:08.031
(gasps)

01:02:08.032 --> 01:02:11.099
- (snoring)
- (giggling)

01:02:12.399 --> 01:02:14.268
(whispers):
Come here!

01:02:14.269 --> 01:02:16.731
LUIGI:
Whee.

01:02:18.009 --> 01:02:20.109
- Luigi!
- (giggles)

01:02:20.110 --> 01:02:21.638
What are you doing?

01:02:21.639 --> 01:02:23.541
Stop it!

01:02:23.542 --> 01:02:25.015
(drumming)

01:02:25.016 --> 01:02:27.281
(snoring continues)

01:02:27.282 --> 01:02:30.217
(dinosaur yawning)

01:02:30.923 --> 01:02:33.188
- (giggles)
- Mario!

01:02:33.189 --> 01:02:35.586
(panting rapidly)

01:02:35.587 --> 01:02:37.159
(straining)

01:02:37.160 --> 01:02:40.326
- (grunts)
- (muffled giggling)

01:02:40.757 --> 01:02:42.263
(Toad gasps)

01:02:42.264 --> 01:02:44.496
(giggles)

01:02:44.497 --> 01:02:46.729
- (dinosaur snorting)
- (Toad whimpers)

01:02:46.730 --> 01:02:48.907
- (squeals)
- Shh!

01:02:48.908 --> 01:02:50.733
(sneezes)

01:02:50.734 --> 01:02:52.372
(laughs)

01:02:52.373 --> 01:02:53.769
(grunts)

01:02:53.770 --> 01:02:55.308
(giggles)

01:02:55.882 --> 01:02:58.279
(sighs heavily)

01:02:58.280 --> 01:03:00.643
(exhales)

01:03:01.316 --> 01:03:02.052
Yoshi!

01:03:02.053 --> 01:03:04.923
(echoing):
Yoshi! Yoshi!

01:03:04.924 --> 01:03:07.617
(snarls)

01:03:13.493 --> 01:03:15.592
(high-pitched roar)

01:03:16.628 --> 01:03:20.168
(roaring ferociously)

01:03:20.764 --> 01:03:23.436
- (Toad screams)
- (Yoshi warbling)

01:03:23.437 --> 01:03:25.174
(Toad yelps)

01:03:25.175 --> 01:03:27.110
(snarling)

01:03:27.111 --> 01:03:29.574
(Yoshi yelps)

01:03:29.575 --> 01:03:31.982
- (Luigi giggles)
- Here.

01:03:32.083 --> 01:03:33.853
- (weapon whirring)
- Hey... Wait, wait.

01:03:33.854 --> 01:03:35.514
Oh, no. Let-let go!
Let go! Let go! Let go!

01:03:35.515 --> 01:03:37.318
Give it! Give it!
Give it to me!

01:03:37.319 --> 01:03:39.924
Give me... Give me the gun!

01:03:40.619 --> 01:03:43.159
- (coos)
- (giggling)

01:03:43.160 --> 01:03:46.624
(roaring)

01:03:46.625 --> 01:03:49.065
(Yoshi warbling)

01:03:52.169 --> 01:03:53.499
(yelps)

01:03:53.500 --> 01:03:55.874
(Mario squeals)

01:03:59.737 --> 01:04:02.012
(rumbling)

01:04:03.411 --> 01:04:06.412
- (roaring)
- (whimpers)

01:04:13.487 --> 01:04:15.927
(Yoshi screams)

01:04:20.857 --> 01:04:23.825
(gasping, coughing)

01:04:28.304 --> 01:04:31.239
(roaring ferociously)

01:04:34.046 --> 01:04:35.914
(panicked warbling)

01:04:38.710 --> 01:04:41.645
♪ ♪

01:04:42.120 --> 01:04:43.615
(chirring softly)

01:04:43.616 --> 01:04:46.320
(babies giggling)

01:04:46.718 --> 01:04:49.290
(Mario grunts, giggles)

01:04:49.853 --> 01:04:51.656
(Yoshi grunts)

01:04:51.657 --> 01:04:53.790
(crying)

01:04:53.791 --> 01:04:56.364
(crying continues)

01:04:56.365 --> 01:04:57.728
Oh. Uh...

01:04:57.729 --> 01:04:59.762
(clears throat, sniffs)

01:05:01.106 --> 01:05:03.140
I kind of liked being a baby.

01:05:03.141 --> 01:05:05.571
All the scary thoughts
running through my head

01:05:05.572 --> 01:05:08.079
just disappeared, you know?

01:05:08.080 --> 01:05:08.948
(gasps)

01:05:08.949 --> 01:05:10.642
We're gonna fix you up
like new, okay?

01:05:10.643 --> 01:05:13.381
(whimpering): It's gonna
be fine. It's just a dent.

01:05:13.382 --> 01:05:15.845
(tearfully):
Just a dent.

01:05:15.846 --> 01:05:17.957
(crying)

01:05:17.958 --> 01:05:20.784
(Princess Peach grunting
in frustration)

01:05:20.785 --> 01:05:23.819
(grunting continues)

01:05:24.195 --> 01:05:25.096
(panting)

01:05:25.097 --> 01:05:28.561
Hey. We are gonna find
a way off this planet.

01:05:28.562 --> 01:05:31.597
Mario, we're galaxies away
from Rosalina,

01:05:31.598 --> 01:05:33.170
we can't fix the ship,

01:05:33.171 --> 01:05:35.634
and somehow
we keep adding dinosaurs!

01:05:35.635 --> 01:05:37.702
(dinosaur grunts inquisitively)

01:05:37.703 --> 01:05:39.143
I know you're frustrated.

01:05:39.144 --> 01:05:41.508
Princesses don't
get frustrated!

01:05:41.509 --> 01:05:46.117
All right. Well, then can I be
not frustrated with you?

01:05:46.118 --> 01:05:48.086
(chuckles)

01:05:48.087 --> 01:05:51.056
- (grunting)
- (grunting, laughing)

01:05:51.057 --> 01:05:53.354
(clicks)

01:05:54.060 --> 01:05:55.225
Uh, breaker, breaker.

01:05:55.226 --> 01:05:57.590
This is Big Green
with Little Red
and the Legal Beagle.

01:05:57.591 --> 01:05:59.955
Uh, we are looking
for an evac...

01:05:59.956 --> 01:06:01.033
(over speaker):
...ASAP.

01:06:01.034 --> 01:06:02.826
Had a major fender bender
in dino-town.

01:06:02.827 --> 01:06:04.861
- Uh, we're hauling some
royal cargo...
- (chatters)

01:06:04.862 --> 01:06:06.863
...a thunder lizard and...
(continues indistinctly)

01:06:06.864 --> 01:06:08.931
- Come on!
- You can do it!

01:06:08.932 --> 01:06:10.867
(excited chattering)

01:06:10.868 --> 01:06:13.276
- Ow!
- (screams)

01:06:13.277 --> 01:06:14.673
(yells)

01:06:14.674 --> 01:06:16.047
(grunts)

01:06:16.511 --> 01:06:17.808
Woo-hoo!

01:06:17.809 --> 01:06:19.084
(excited chattering)

01:06:19.085 --> 01:06:22.978
(singsongy): Look what happens
when you don't have a bedtime.

01:06:22.979 --> 01:06:25.585
- (Luma squealing)
- (over radio): Mayday, Mayday.

01:06:25.586 --> 01:06:28.852
This is the big Luigi dog
saying over and out.

01:06:28.853 --> 01:06:31.623
Luigi?

01:06:32.593 --> 01:06:35.297
♪ ♪

01:06:39.270 --> 01:06:41.997
Their mustaches
were ridiculous,

01:06:41.998 --> 01:06:44.835
but they weren't bad guys.

01:06:44.836 --> 01:06:46.573
They were your friends, huh?

01:06:46.574 --> 01:06:49.048
Nothing's more dangerous
than a friend.

01:06:49.049 --> 01:06:53.580
When your armor's down,
they'll stab you in the back.

01:06:53.581 --> 01:06:54.779
Where did you hear that?

01:06:54.780 --> 01:06:57.287
It's what you told me
when you dropped me off

01:06:57.288 --> 01:06:59.685
for my first day of school.

01:06:59.686 --> 01:07:01.390
I am a good dad.

01:07:01.391 --> 01:07:04.558
Those friends of yours
tried to ruin you,

01:07:04.559 --> 01:07:06.857
turn you into
something you're not.

01:07:06.858 --> 01:07:09.992
You know who won't hurt you?

01:07:09.993 --> 01:07:12.071
Your family.

01:07:12.072 --> 01:07:14.271
Family is forever.

01:07:14.272 --> 01:07:17.108
Close your eyes.

01:07:22.478 --> 01:07:23.478
Dad.

01:07:23.479 --> 01:07:25.810
Wait for it.

01:07:25.811 --> 01:07:28.153
Now, open.

01:07:28.154 --> 01:07:29.682
(gasps)

01:07:29.683 --> 01:07:32.420
♪ ♪

01:07:44.698 --> 01:07:48.173
Guys, there's something
extremely weird

01:07:48.174 --> 01:07:50.438
flying towards us.

01:07:57.315 --> 01:07:59.877
- Wow.
- Wow.

01:07:59.878 --> 01:08:02.582
♪ ♪

01:08:08.051 --> 01:08:10.657
- (excited chattering)
- Mario!

01:08:10.658 --> 01:08:12.658
Let's-a go!

01:08:13.298 --> 01:08:16.596
(engines whooshing)

01:08:26.476 --> 01:08:29.004
(laughter)

01:08:29.281 --> 01:08:35.010
We'll be at the Space Junk
Galaxy before nap time.

01:08:38.554 --> 01:08:41.588
(Lumas trilling, laughing)

01:08:41.986 --> 01:08:44.921
(hinges creak)

01:08:48.927 --> 01:08:51.664
♪ ♪

01:09:16.119 --> 01:09:17.460
ROSALINA:
Once upon a time,

01:09:17.461 --> 01:09:22.762
there was a brave
and noble princess named Peach.

01:09:22.763 --> 01:09:24.697
(gasps)

01:09:25.535 --> 01:09:29.702
Her story begins
many years ago...

01:09:30.001 --> 01:09:32.475
...when she lived
on a small planet

01:09:32.476 --> 01:09:34.873
with her sister, Rosalina.

01:09:34.874 --> 01:09:39.218
The two sisters were
made of stardust.

01:09:39.219 --> 01:09:40.648
♪ ♪

01:09:40.649 --> 01:09:42.848
(Rosalina and Peach giggling)

01:09:42.849 --> 01:09:48.150
Their love burned as brightly
as the stars themselves.

01:09:48.151 --> 01:09:49.184
(giggling)

01:09:49.185 --> 01:09:54.595
Together, they could summon
the power of the cosmos.

01:09:57.831 --> 01:09:59.930
♪ ♪

01:10:06.708 --> 01:10:12.580
But evil forces wanted
the power for themselves.

01:10:13.077 --> 01:10:20.148
Rosalina had to send
Peach away to safety.

01:10:28.499 --> 01:10:30.698
YOUNG PEACH:
No! No!

01:10:30.699 --> 01:10:33.370
(screaming)

01:10:35.374 --> 01:10:38.508
ROSALINA: The Toads raised
and protected her

01:10:38.509 --> 01:10:44.040
until she grew strong enough
to protect them.

01:10:44.350 --> 01:10:47.076
♪ ♪

01:11:00.157 --> 01:11:05.864
Dad, welcome to Planet Bowser!

01:11:06.537 --> 01:11:09.439
(happy chattering)

01:11:13.104 --> 01:11:15.610
(cheering)

01:11:16.481 --> 01:11:18.844
(cheering)

01:11:23.983 --> 01:11:26.149
You really built all this?

01:11:26.150 --> 01:11:27.216
But that's not all.

01:11:27.217 --> 01:11:32.759
We have our very own
Boomsday Weapon!

01:11:34.598 --> 01:11:39.799
And the princess I kidnapped
to power it.

01:11:40.373 --> 01:11:42.165
(Rosalina grunts, groans)

01:11:42.166 --> 01:11:45.674
The universe will
never forgive you.

01:11:45.675 --> 01:11:47.676
This is who you are.

01:11:47.677 --> 01:11:49.106
This is where you belong.

01:11:49.107 --> 01:11:52.813
Tonight we destroy
the Mushroom Kingdom.

01:11:52.814 --> 01:11:56.211
Tomorrow the universe!

01:11:56.653 --> 01:12:01.855
CROWD (chanting):
Bowser! Bowser! Bowser! Bowser!

01:12:01.856 --> 01:12:05.430
Bowser! Bowser! Bowser!

01:12:05.431 --> 01:12:09.059
Yeah! Long live the king!

01:12:09.402 --> 01:12:12.194
They're waiting for you.

01:12:12.438 --> 01:12:13.372
(crowd quiets)

01:12:13.373 --> 01:12:17.266
Sometimes,
on this Rainbow Road of life,

01:12:17.267 --> 01:12:18.201
we lose our way.

01:12:18.202 --> 01:12:22.139
But if you're lucky,
a tiny version of yourself

01:12:22.140 --> 01:12:26.176
helps you remember
your true calling.

01:12:26.177 --> 01:12:28.948
My Koopas...

01:12:28.949 --> 01:12:31.082
your king has returned!

01:12:31.083 --> 01:12:34.084
(cheering loudly)

01:12:34.691 --> 01:12:35.988
(whimpers)

01:12:35.989 --> 01:12:38.760
(energy crackling)

01:12:38.761 --> 01:12:40.563
(gasps)

01:12:46.296 --> 01:12:49.066
(whooshing)

01:12:51.235 --> 01:12:54.104
(energy crackling)

01:13:00.816 --> 01:13:02.377
(crackling)

01:13:02.378 --> 01:13:04.719
(whimpers)

01:13:05.524 --> 01:13:07.315
(chuckles)

01:13:09.561 --> 01:13:11.496
(whimpers)

01:13:11.497 --> 01:13:12.860
(cries out)

01:13:12.861 --> 01:13:14.993
♪ ♪

01:13:25.577 --> 01:13:27.511
(crackling)

01:13:37.853 --> 01:13:40.349
FOX:
We'll get you on the planet.

01:13:40.350 --> 01:13:41.790
Buckle up.

01:13:41.791 --> 01:13:44.825
It's about to get crazy.

01:13:46.026 --> 01:13:49.291
Star Fox team is ready.

01:13:50.767 --> 01:13:52.295
- Sick.
- (giggling)

01:13:52.296 --> 01:13:55.330
(Lumas chattering excitedly)

01:13:56.102 --> 01:13:58.509
(Lumas trilling)

01:14:02.009 --> 01:14:04.647
(Lumas squeal excitedly)

01:14:14.087 --> 01:14:15.494
♪ ♪

01:14:15.495 --> 01:14:18.056
(engine revving)

01:14:18.993 --> 01:14:20.257
Let's do this.

01:14:20.258 --> 01:14:23.534
- (engine revving)
- (others gasp)

01:14:26.000 --> 01:14:28.671
Incoming!

01:14:29.201 --> 01:14:31.675
(Koopas grunt, cry out)

01:14:31.676 --> 01:14:34.205
Do a barrel roll!

01:14:34.206 --> 01:14:35.910
(Koopas yelling)

01:14:35.911 --> 01:14:37.747
- (Lumas exclaim)
- Yay!

01:14:37.748 --> 01:14:40.276
(explosions)

01:14:44.282 --> 01:14:46.018
(whimpering)

01:14:47.956 --> 01:14:49.792
You're up, Mustache!

01:14:49.793 --> 01:14:51.958
Good luck.

01:14:55.766 --> 01:14:58.129
MARIO:
Wahoo!

01:14:59.330 --> 01:15:01.331
(Yoshi exclaims)

01:15:01.332 --> 01:15:03.937
(Luigi grunts)

01:15:04.302 --> 01:15:07.578
(Mario and Princess Peach
grunting)

01:15:15.049 --> 01:15:17.280
Wahoo!

01:15:19.856 --> 01:15:22.054
(grunts)

01:15:23.695 --> 01:15:26.257
(cannons firing)

01:15:26.258 --> 01:15:29.028
(propeller whirring)

01:15:35.003 --> 01:15:37.807
(whispers):
I don't know what that means.

01:15:37.808 --> 01:15:41.008
It means you go this way,
we go that way.

01:15:41.009 --> 01:15:42.679
Oh. Got ya.

01:15:43.814 --> 01:15:46.507
♪ ♪

01:15:57.520 --> 01:15:59.597
(shouting)

01:16:02.360 --> 01:16:05.097
♪ ♪

01:16:07.706 --> 01:16:10.003
(grunting)

01:16:16.781 --> 01:16:18.507
(barking)

01:16:18.508 --> 01:16:20.750
(Luigi yelps)

01:16:23.183 --> 01:16:24.689
(grunts)

01:16:24.690 --> 01:16:27.317
YOSHI:
Oh.

01:16:32.159 --> 01:16:33.225
(Mario gasps)

01:16:33.226 --> 01:16:35.799
Intruder alert! Intruder alert!

01:16:35.800 --> 01:16:37.734
Get them!

01:16:39.903 --> 01:16:40.837
(grunts weakly)

01:16:40.838 --> 01:16:42.498
It won't be long now, Dad.

01:16:42.499 --> 01:16:44.775
- (Kamek clears throat)
- BOTH: What?!

01:16:44.776 --> 01:16:48.911
My lords,
our tormentors have returned!

01:16:48.912 --> 01:16:50.209
(Bowser growls in frustration)

01:16:50.210 --> 01:16:51.573
I'll take care of 'em.

01:16:51.574 --> 01:16:56.313
I built a security system
that's next-level.

01:16:58.856 --> 01:17:01.759
They're gonna get
torn to pieces.

01:17:01.760 --> 01:17:03.255
(laughs gleefully)

01:17:03.256 --> 01:17:04.663
I love being a dad.

01:17:04.664 --> 01:17:09.799
Oh, the days are long,
but the years are short.

01:17:10.593 --> 01:17:12.836
- (alarm beeping)
- (both yelp)

01:17:12.837 --> 01:17:15.267
(Mario screams)

01:17:15.268 --> 01:17:17.708
(grunts)

01:17:29.755 --> 01:17:33.383
BOWSER JR. (over speaker):
Hello, Peach and Mario.

01:17:34.859 --> 01:17:38.620
Prepare to meet your maker.

01:17:38.621 --> 01:17:40.028
(whooshes)

01:17:40.029 --> 01:17:41.831
(Princess Peach yelps)

01:17:44.627 --> 01:17:46.067
(gasps)

01:17:46.068 --> 01:17:48.333
(cackles)

01:17:48.334 --> 01:17:50.598
♪ ♪

01:17:55.979 --> 01:17:57.947
(gasps)

01:17:57.948 --> 01:17:59.949
(yells)

01:17:59.950 --> 01:18:01.576
(gasps)

01:18:04.922 --> 01:18:06.021
(grunts)

01:18:06.022 --> 01:18:08.418
(growls)

01:18:08.827 --> 01:18:12.026
♪ ♪

01:18:14.690 --> 01:18:17.097
(grunting)

01:18:22.808 --> 01:18:24.841
(yells)

01:18:30.948 --> 01:18:32.541
(growls)

01:18:38.120 --> 01:18:40.450
PRINCESS PEACH:
Whoa!

01:18:42.355 --> 01:18:44.290
(fuses sizzling)

01:18:44.291 --> 01:18:46.456
(gasps)

01:18:48.361 --> 01:18:51.527
(cackles) I've got you now.

01:18:56.842 --> 01:18:58.633
(grunts)

01:19:00.538 --> 01:19:02.307
(cackles)

01:19:05.213 --> 01:19:06.741
(fuses sizzling)

01:19:06.742 --> 01:19:08.985
(multiple explosions)

01:19:08.986 --> 01:19:11.823
- (Princess Peach grunts)
- (Mario exclaims)

01:19:11.824 --> 01:19:13.825
♪ ♪

01:19:13.826 --> 01:19:15.650
MARIO:
Woo-hoo!

01:19:19.799 --> 01:19:22.998
("Course Clear" playing)

01:19:27.972 --> 01:19:32.007
I won't let them ruin this.

01:19:35.078 --> 01:19:37.309
(both grunt)

01:19:42.954 --> 01:19:45.285
(whooshing)

01:19:45.286 --> 01:19:47.287
(Mario grunts)

01:19:47.288 --> 01:19:50.058
(blades scraping)

01:19:50.621 --> 01:19:52.489
(metallic clang)

01:19:52.865 --> 01:19:54.096
Bowser.

01:19:54.097 --> 01:19:55.625
(low growl)

01:19:55.626 --> 01:19:57.396
It didn't have to be this way.

01:19:57.397 --> 01:20:00.663
I know there's still
some good in there.

01:20:00.664 --> 01:20:03.973
- (Bowser roars)
- (Princess Peach gasps)

01:20:05.339 --> 01:20:07.703
♪ ♪

01:20:07.704 --> 01:20:10.079
Let us pass. Now.

01:20:10.080 --> 01:20:10.915
Or what?

01:20:10.916 --> 01:20:12.609
You'll humiliate me
at my wedding?

01:20:12.610 --> 01:20:16.514
Shrink me to a nubbin
and put me in a jar?

01:20:16.515 --> 01:20:18.582
Make me join a book club?!

01:20:18.583 --> 01:20:19.858
We had our moment, Mario,

01:20:19.859 --> 01:20:25.963
but Bowser is back,
and now you'll feel my fury!

01:20:25.964 --> 01:20:28.690
(flames whooshing)

01:20:33.664 --> 01:20:36.698
♪ ♪

01:20:41.243 --> 01:20:43.309
(growls, roars)

01:20:46.985 --> 01:20:49.679
No. No. No...!

01:20:49.680 --> 01:20:51.417
(screaming fades)

01:20:51.418 --> 01:20:52.550
(chimes)

01:20:52.551 --> 01:20:54.156
Dad!

01:20:54.157 --> 01:20:56.894
♪ ♪

01:21:13.209 --> 01:21:15.737
(sobs):
Dad.

01:21:22.713 --> 01:21:24.747
(lava bubbling)

01:21:24.748 --> 01:21:27.419
♪ ♪

01:21:36.067 --> 01:21:38.464
I am the lord of bones!

01:21:38.465 --> 01:21:41.170
I am the skull king!

01:21:41.171 --> 01:21:43.535
And I'm his son!

01:21:43.536 --> 01:21:45.800
(both roaring viciously)

01:21:59.288 --> 01:22:00.650
Mario!

01:22:02.060 --> 01:22:03.291
Go.

01:22:03.292 --> 01:22:05.028
Save her.

01:22:12.862 --> 01:22:14.632
(both growling)

01:22:14.633 --> 01:22:17.502
(energy crackling)

01:22:17.867 --> 01:22:19.472
(panting)

01:22:19.473 --> 01:22:21.275
(grunts)

01:22:23.939 --> 01:22:26.643
(pants, grunts)

01:22:30.187 --> 01:22:31.846
(yells)

01:22:32.354 --> 01:22:33.915
Oh!

01:22:33.916 --> 01:22:35.488
Whoa! Oh!

01:22:35.489 --> 01:22:37.951
(grunts, cries out)

01:22:45.928 --> 01:22:47.961
(grunts)

01:22:50.108 --> 01:22:52.142
(grunts, yelps)

01:22:52.143 --> 01:22:54.143
Whoa!

01:22:58.479 --> 01:23:00.974
♪ ♪

01:23:01.383 --> 01:23:03.713
(Bowser Jr. yells)

01:23:07.158 --> 01:23:09.125
(Bowser grunts)

01:23:09.358 --> 01:23:11.227
(pained grunt)

01:23:11.228 --> 01:23:12.459
(groans)

01:23:12.460 --> 01:23:14.032
(Bowser Jr. cackles)

01:23:14.033 --> 01:23:15.297
(roars)

01:23:15.298 --> 01:23:16.397
(grunts)

01:23:16.398 --> 01:23:18.167
Ow!

01:23:19.335 --> 01:23:21.500
Yoshi.

01:23:22.074 --> 01:23:25.405
("Power-Up" plays)

01:23:25.671 --> 01:23:26.968
Very weird.

01:23:26.969 --> 01:23:28.409
(strained grunting)

01:23:28.410 --> 01:23:30.740
(Bowser Jr. growls)

01:23:31.149 --> 01:23:33.875
(yelling, grunting)

01:23:35.945 --> 01:23:38.088
BOWSER:
Ow!

01:23:39.520 --> 01:23:41.818
(Luigi yells)

01:23:41.819 --> 01:23:44.424
- (Bowser cries out)
- LUIGI: Whoa!

01:23:50.234 --> 01:23:52.564
(growls fiercely)

01:23:56.031 --> 01:23:57.669
(grunting rapidly)

01:23:57.670 --> 01:23:58.439
(screams)

01:23:58.440 --> 01:24:00.540
(distorted):
Whoa!

01:24:00.541 --> 01:24:02.509
- (grunts)
- ("Power-Down" plays)

01:24:02.510 --> 01:24:03.971
(roars)

01:24:05.810 --> 01:24:06.711
(growls fiercely)

01:24:06.712 --> 01:24:09.615
- (grunts)
- ("Power-Down" plays)

01:24:09.616 --> 01:24:10.979
(groans)

01:24:10.980 --> 01:24:12.189
(gasps)

01:24:12.190 --> 01:24:13.883
(Bowser and Bowser Jr. cackle)

01:24:13.884 --> 01:24:16.160
- (snarls)
- (bones crack)

01:24:16.161 --> 01:24:18.326
(air hissing)

01:24:19.098 --> 01:24:21.296
(fluttering)

01:24:21.529 --> 01:24:23.662
(Yoshi warbling)

01:24:23.663 --> 01:24:25.564
(Yoshi yelling)

01:24:26.402 --> 01:24:28.106
(yelling continues)

01:24:28.107 --> 01:24:30.339
(Bowser Jr. grunts)

01:24:30.340 --> 01:24:33.033
♪ ♪

01:24:33.508 --> 01:24:34.937
Finish this, Lu.

01:24:34.938 --> 01:24:37.147
(roaring fiercely)

01:24:37.941 --> 01:24:40.217
(grunting)

01:24:40.218 --> 01:24:41.317
Ha!

01:24:41.318 --> 01:24:42.582
- Lu!
- What?

01:24:42.583 --> 01:24:44.716
You know I never learned
how to draw!

01:24:44.717 --> 01:24:47.586
- (growls)
- (chirping footsteps)

01:24:48.292 --> 01:24:49.721
(roars)

01:24:49.722 --> 01:24:51.128
(grunts)

01:24:51.691 --> 01:24:53.328
(roars)

01:24:54.023 --> 01:24:55.199
(Bowser grunts)

01:24:55.200 --> 01:24:56.827
(explosion)

01:24:56.828 --> 01:24:58.091
Yes!

01:24:58.797 --> 01:25:00.061
No!

01:25:00.062 --> 01:25:01.567
(grunts)

01:25:02.240 --> 01:25:04.405
(screams)

01:25:10.710 --> 01:25:13.249
(screams)

01:25:13.680 --> 01:25:15.581
(Luigi cries out)

01:25:18.047 --> 01:25:19.289
(roars)

01:25:19.290 --> 01:25:22.159
(thundering footfalls)

01:25:24.295 --> 01:25:26.460
(hissing roar)

01:25:29.696 --> 01:25:32.126
(roars ferociously)

01:25:32.127 --> 01:25:33.797
(Luigi yelps)

01:25:34.239 --> 01:25:35.833
In the name of the Koopas...

01:25:35.834 --> 01:25:38.242
- (Bowser Jr. yelps)
- (exclaiming)

01:25:38.243 --> 01:25:40.442
(screaming)

01:25:40.443 --> 01:25:41.212
Junior!

01:25:41.213 --> 01:25:44.907
(whimpering):
Daddy! Please help me!

01:25:46.416 --> 01:25:48.647
(screaming)

01:25:48.913 --> 01:25:51.683
Junior!

01:25:53.654 --> 01:25:55.753
♪ ♪

01:25:56.151 --> 01:25:58.690
("Power-Up" plays)

01:26:01.662 --> 01:26:04.663
(chomping)

01:26:14.840 --> 01:26:17.280
♪ ♪

01:26:18.415 --> 01:26:20.107
(laughing)

01:26:20.615 --> 01:26:22.516
- (splashes)
- (cries out)

01:26:23.453 --> 01:26:25.289
- Dad!
- (laughs)

01:26:25.290 --> 01:26:27.521
Oh, my boy.

01:26:28.755 --> 01:26:31.657
(power ramping up)

01:26:32.055 --> 01:26:34.363
(grunting)

01:26:34.992 --> 01:26:37.399
(strained grunting)

01:26:38.600 --> 01:26:40.161
(grunts)

01:26:40.162 --> 01:26:42.734
(cries out)

01:26:47.609 --> 01:26:49.675
(bangs)

01:26:53.109 --> 01:26:55.109
(gasps)

01:26:58.048 --> 01:27:00.422
Rosalina.

01:27:02.118 --> 01:27:03.722
(groans weakly)

01:27:05.088 --> 01:27:06.594
(grunts)

01:27:06.595 --> 01:27:09.530
I need you to try.

01:27:15.164 --> 01:27:17.901
♪ ♪

01:27:20.312 --> 01:27:21.641
(gasps)

01:27:23.007 --> 01:27:25.711
♪ ♪

01:27:32.456 --> 01:27:34.753
(whooshing)

01:27:44.831 --> 01:27:46.864
(Yoshi laughs)

01:27:58.240 --> 01:28:01.384
♪ ♪

01:28:01.617 --> 01:28:04.453
I knew you would come for me.

01:28:06.688 --> 01:28:10.152
Hey! Found your femur, Dad.

01:28:10.153 --> 01:28:11.428
Doing great, my boy.

01:28:11.429 --> 01:28:13.694
Let's find my foot.

01:28:13.695 --> 01:28:16.499
PRINCESS PEACH (laughing):
Mario! Mario.

01:28:16.500 --> 01:28:18.567
Come meet my sister.

01:28:18.568 --> 01:28:21.372
I am so happy
you found each other.

01:28:21.373 --> 01:28:23.671
I love a family reunion.

01:28:23.672 --> 01:28:25.442
BOTH:
Heyo!

01:28:25.443 --> 01:28:26.509
(laughing)

01:28:26.510 --> 01:28:29.137
(ship engine rumbling)

01:28:32.307 --> 01:28:34.945
(wind whooshes)

01:28:37.554 --> 01:28:38.554
Mama?

01:28:38.555 --> 01:28:40.314
- Oh, Mama.
- (happy chattering)

01:28:40.315 --> 01:28:44.428
ROSALINA (laughing):
Oh. My babies.

01:28:44.429 --> 01:28:46.496
We missed you so much.

01:28:46.497 --> 01:28:47.695
I missed you, too.

01:28:47.696 --> 01:28:51.226
Mama, can we visit
the Mushroom Kingdom?

01:28:51.227 --> 01:28:52.832
I want to see the castle.

01:28:52.833 --> 01:28:54.834
(giggles) Okay, okay.

01:28:54.835 --> 01:28:57.330
(Lumas screaming excitedly)

01:29:02.271 --> 01:29:05.415
Where's your castle?

01:29:05.780 --> 01:29:07.176
Uh, well, the castle.

01:29:07.177 --> 01:29:09.211
Yeah, the castle, um...

01:29:09.212 --> 01:29:11.311
It died.

01:29:12.215 --> 01:29:14.623
What are you talking about?

01:29:14.624 --> 01:29:15.657
You know what, guys?

01:29:15.658 --> 01:29:18.825
We're gonna rebuild
the best castle ever.

01:29:18.826 --> 01:29:21.090
Who wants to help?

01:29:23.567 --> 01:29:25.029
(popping)

01:29:25.030 --> 01:29:27.899
- Oh, yeah.
- Woo-hoo!

01:29:28.198 --> 01:29:30.770
♪ ♪

01:29:35.172 --> 01:29:36.546
(boings)

01:29:36.547 --> 01:29:38.778
("Power-Down" plays)

01:29:49.318 --> 01:29:51.627
(chimes)

01:29:51.628 --> 01:29:54.431
("Power-Up" plays)

01:29:56.501 --> 01:29:58.292
(kisses)

01:29:58.932 --> 01:30:00.735
Wahoo!

01:30:00.736 --> 01:30:03.440
♪ ♪

01:30:10.779 --> 01:30:13.582
♪ ♪

01:30:38.642 --> 01:30:41.335
♪ ♪

01:31:10.674 --> 01:31:13.367
♪ ♪

01:31:37.998 --> 01:31:40.702
♪ ♪

01:32:10.327 --> 01:32:13.031
♪ ♪

01:32:30.787 --> 01:32:32.084
So, where are you off to next?

01:32:32.085 --> 01:32:35.252
That nice space princess
fixed up my warp drive,

01:32:35.253 --> 01:32:37.958
and I'm heading home.

01:32:37.959 --> 01:32:39.487
Good luck with them.

01:32:39.488 --> 01:32:42.863
That is one complicated family.

01:32:43.030 --> 01:32:45.427
(engine rumbling)

01:32:45.428 --> 01:32:47.362
(whooshes)

01:32:47.804 --> 01:32:49.804
(distant boom)

01:32:49.905 --> 01:32:51.202
(Bowser Jr. grunts)

01:32:51.203 --> 01:32:52.841
Don't worry, son.

01:32:52.842 --> 01:32:54.645
No jail can hold us.

01:32:54.646 --> 01:32:56.438
We'll be out of here soon.

01:32:56.439 --> 01:32:57.747
(metallic clanking)

01:32:57.748 --> 01:33:00.573
(clanking continues)

01:33:04.920 --> 01:33:06.547
Hello, maggots.

01:33:06.548 --> 01:33:08.351
Trying to escape?

01:33:08.352 --> 01:33:09.418
(both gasp)

01:33:09.419 --> 01:33:11.288
You're gonna play
by my rules now.

01:33:11.289 --> 01:33:12.894
- (whimpers)
- Stay close, son.

01:33:12.895 --> 01:33:13.994
She won't break us.

01:33:13.995 --> 01:33:16.700
First goes the body,
then goes the bones.

01:33:16.701 --> 01:33:20.638
(giggles)
Then all that's left is dust.

01:33:20.639 --> 01:33:23.036
You be quiet right now.

01:33:23.037 --> 01:33:25.269
You can't silence the truth.

01:33:25.270 --> 01:33:26.710
It only makes it louder.

01:33:26.711 --> 01:33:30.538
Like the approaching
drumbeat of death!

01:33:30.539 --> 01:33:32.243
(laughing)

01:33:32.244 --> 01:33:33.442
Boom, boom,

01:33:33.443 --> 01:33:37.511
- boom, boom.
- BOTH: No!

01:33:39.119 --> 01:33:41.823
♪ ♪

01:34:11.151 --> 01:34:13.855
♪ ♪

01:34:42.886 --> 01:34:45.579
♪ ♪

01:35:14.918 --> 01:35:17.611
♪ ♪

01:35:46.950 --> 01:35:49.643
♪ ♪

01:36:18.982 --> 01:36:21.675
♪ ♪

01:36:51.014 --> 01:36:53.707
♪ ♪

01:37:23.046 --> 01:37:25.739
♪ ♪

01:37:44.397 --> 01:37:45.463
(Ukiki whimpers, crying)

01:37:45.464 --> 01:37:48.664
Oh. There, there,
you poor little monkey.

01:37:48.665 --> 01:37:50.732
- (Ukiki cackles)
- Ow.

01:37:50.733 --> 01:37:52.766
(grunts)

01:37:53.241 --> 01:37:54.604
(cackling)

01:37:54.605 --> 01:37:55.506
(grunts)

01:37:55.507 --> 01:37:57.980
(squeaks, moans)

01:37:58.576 --> 01:38:01.116
Well, thank you very much...

01:38:01.117 --> 01:38:02.920
Your Highness.

01:38:02.921 --> 01:38:04.515
♪ ♪

01:38:04.516 --> 01:38:05.989
(bell dings)

01:38:05.990 --> 01:38:08.254
(music ends)
